<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">MRK- Aromanian Frasherot</book>
  <para style="h">Marcu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Evanghelu Dupã Marcu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Marcu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mrc</para>
  <para style="mt1">Evanghelu Dupã Marcu</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Ahurhita a Evanghelui al Isus Hristos, Hiljilu al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Ashã cum easti scriatã la prufitlu Isaia:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">
    <char style="it">“Ia, mini [Dumnidzãlu] ma pitrec mãndatorlu a meu nãintea a fatsãljei a ta,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">
    <char style="it">cai va ts-ndreagã calea nãintea a ta,</char><verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />
    <char style="it">boatsea atsilui tsi aurlã tu irnjii:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">
    <char style="it">‘Ndridzets-u calea a Domnului,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">
    <char style="it">ndriptats cãljurili a lui!’”</char><verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Ioanul vini tu irnjii pãtidzãnda sh-predicãnda un pitedz trã mitãnjiusirea a amãrtiilor tsi Dumnidzãlu s-li ljeartã. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Sh-tut loclu al Iudei sh-atselji di Ierusalem njidzea la elu shi s-pãtidza tuts di la nãsu la arãulu Iordan aspunãnda amãrtiili a lor. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Ma Ioanul eara nviscut cu stranji di lãnã ali gãmili, tsãnea unã curauã di cheali anvãrliga di ilji shi mãca carcaletsi sh-njeari agrã. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Elu ma predica dzãcãnda: “Dupã mini yini un tsi easti ma vãrtos di mini. Mini nu escu axiu nits s-mi apunã nãintea a lui ti dizligari curaua a-sandalilor a lui. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Mini vã pãtidzai cu apã, ma elu va vã pãteadzã cu Duhlu Sãmtu.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Sh-tu atseali dzãli undzi tsi Isusul vini di Nazaretul a Galileiljei shi s-pãtidzã di Ioanul tu Iordan. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Shi trãoarã cãndu ma isha dit apã, vidzu cã tserurili ma s-discljidea sh-Duhlu ma dipuna pri nãsu ca purumbu. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Sh-unã boatsi vini dit tseruri: “Tini eshti Hiljiu a meu vrut cu cai escu hãrsit.” <verse eid="MRK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Sh-trãoarã Duhlu Sãmtu lu-adusi tu irnjii. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Elu armasi tu irnjii patrudzãtsi di dzãli, cãrtit di Satanlu. Sh-eara deadun cu agrinjili, shi anghilji lj-huzmitipsea.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Shi dupã tsi Ioanul u hãpsãnirã, Isusul vini tu Galilea predicãnda evanghelu al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Sh-dzãcãnda: “Agiumsi chirolu shi s-apruche amirãriljea al Dumnidzãu. Mitãnjusits-vã sh-pistipsits tu evanghelu.”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Tricãnda pri ningã amarea a Galileiljei, vidzu Simonlu sh-Andrea, fratili a lui, arcãnda plãsile tu amari cã eara piscari. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Sh-Isus lã dzãsi a lor: “Urmats-mi sh-mini va vã facã piscari di oaminji.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Sh-trãoarã atselji alãsarã plãsili shi s-dusirã dupã nãsu. <verse eid="MRK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Dupã tsi imnã ninga niheamã, vidzu Iacovul, hiljilu al Zebedeu sh-Ioanul, fratili a lui tsi mpitica plãsili a lor tu varcã. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Sh-trãoarã lji-achljimã sh-elji alãsarã tatãl a lor, Zebedeul tu varcã cu lucrutorlji, shi s-dusirã dupã nãsu.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Deapoea intrarã tu Capernaum shi dzua di Sãmbãtã trãoarã intrarã tu sinagogã shi nvitsa oaminjlji. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Sh-oaminjlji s-ciudisirã di nvitsãtura-a lui, cã elu lji nvitsa ca un tsi ari puteari sh-nu ca scriblji. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Atumtsea tu sinagoga-a lor eara un om putut di un duh nicurat, tsi ahurhi s-aurlã, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />dzãcãnda: “Tsi ari namisa di noi sh-di voi, Isus di Nazaret? Vinish tra s-nã cheri? Mini shtiu cai eshti: Sãmtul al Dumnidzãu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Shi Isusul lu vãrghi dzãcãnda: “Tats sh-eshi dit elu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Sh-duhlu nicurat, dupã tsi lu ascuturã, aurlã cu mari sh-ishi di la nãsu. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Sh-tuts s-ciudisirã ahãntu multu cãt ntriba un-alantu dzãcãnda: Vahi tsi easti aestã? Tsi nvitsãturã noauã easti aestã? Aestu lji urseashti cu puteari duhurili atseali nicurati sh-eali lu ascultã. <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Shi anamea a lui s-avdzã trãoarã pri tut loclu anvãrliga a Galileiljei.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Cum ishirã dit sinagogã, s-dusirã la casa al Simon sh-al Andrea, cu Iacovul sh-cu Ioanul. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Soacra al Simon eara bãgatã cu hevri, sh-trãoarã elji lji-aspusirã ti nãsã. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Atumtsea elu s-apruche, u-acãtsã di mãnã sh-u sculã. Trãoarã hevrili u-alãsarã shi ea ahurhi s-lã huzmitipseascã. <verse eid="MRK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Seara dupã ascãpitata a-soarilui, lji adusirã tuts lãndzitslji shi dracuitslji. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Sh-tut cãsãbãlu eara adunat nãinti di ushi. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Elu vindicã multsã di atselji tsi s-munduea di multi soi ti lãngoari, shi aĝuni multsã dratsi, sh-nu alãsã dratslji si zburãscã, cã elji lu-cunushtea.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Deapoea, dimineatsa curund cãndu ninga nu avea apirit, Isusul si-sculã, ishi shi s-dusi tu un loc ermu sh-aclo s-rugã. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Shi Simonlu sh-atselji tsi eara cu nãsu, lu-cãfta. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Sh-cãndu lu aflarã lji-dzãsirã: “Tuts ma ti caftã.” <verse eid="MRK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Shi elu lã dzãsi a lor: “S-nidzem tu hoarili di aproapi tra s-preadicã sh-aclo, cã ti aestã am vinitã.” <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Sh-elu tricu tutã Galilea predicãnda pri sinagodzãli-a lor sh-aĝunea dratslji.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Sh-vini la elu un lepros, tsi rugãnda lj-cãdzu pri dzinuclji sh-lji dzãsi: “Ma s-vrei tini, pots s-mi curi.” <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Sh-Isusul simtsãnda njilã, timsi mãna pri nãsu sh-lji dzãsi: “Ie, voi, s-hii curat!” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Macãt dzãsi aesti, trãoarã lepra u-alãsã shi s-vindicã. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Deapoea, dupã tsi lu-ursi, trãoarã lu dipãrtã, <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />dzãcãnda: “Vedz s-nu lji aspunji tsiva-a vãrui, ma imnã la preftu, shi dã tsiva trã curarea-a ta, cum easti ursit tu legili a Moisiului, ca mãrtirii trã nãshi.” <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Ma elu, ishinda, apãrnji s-greascã shi s-dimãndã la multsã faptul, ahãntu multu cãt Isusul nu putea s-intra discljis tu cãsãbã, ma stãtea nafoarã pri locuri ermi. Sh-di tuti pãrtsãli yinea la nãsu.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Paralizatlu al Capernaum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Dupã ndoauã dzãli, Isusul vini nãpoi tu Capernaum shi s-avdzã cã elu eara la casã. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Trãoarã s-adunarã ahãntsã multsã oaminji cãt nu aflai loc nitsi dininti ali poarti. Sh-elu lã nvitsa zborlu. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Atumtsea vinirã niscãntsã, tsi adusirã un om paralizat tsi lu-purta patru ishi. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Ma niputãnda s-apruchea di itia a multsãmiljei, dizvãlirã plocili a citiiljei iu eara Isusul, sh-dupã tsi disfeatsirã unã guvã lu-dipusirã patlu pi cai stãtea paralizatlu. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Isusul vidzãnda pistea a lor lji-dzãsi a paralizatlui: “Hilje, amãrtiili a tali tsã suntu ljirtati!” <verse eid="MRK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Ma atsia shidea niscãntsã scribi tsi tu ininjli a lor minduea: <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Cãtse vahi aestu ma blastimã? Cai poati s-ljeartã amãrtiili, dicãt mash unlu, Dumnidzãlu?” <verse eid="MRK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Ma Isusul tsi trãoarã aduchi tu suflitlu a lui cã elji ma minduea aesti lucri cu mintea-a lor, lã dzãsi: “Cãtse li minduits aesti lucri tu ininjli a voastri? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Tsi easti ma lishor s-lji dzãts a paralizatlui: ‘Amãrtiili a tali tsã-suntu ljirtati’, ama s-lji dzãts: ‘Scoalã-ti, ljea patlu a tãu sh-imnã!’? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Ma tra si-shtits cã Hiljiu-a Omlui ari puteari s-ljeartã amãrtiili pri loc, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />mini ma lj-dzãc: ‘Scoalã-ti, ljea patlu sh-imnã la casa a ta!’” <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Sh-elu si sculã trãoarã, lo patlu a lui, sh-ishi afoarã dininti a tutulor, sh-ashã tuts s-ciudisirã sh-alãvdarã Dumnidzãlu dzãcãnda: “Unã ahtari thavmã nu u-avem vidzut pute!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Acljimarea al Levi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Isusul ishi nãpoi mardzina di amari sh-multsãmea yinea la nãsu sh-elu lã-nvitsa. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Tricãnda vidzu Levi, hiljiu al Alfeu apunat iu s-plãtea taxa, sh-lji dzãsi: “Urmeadzã-mi!” Sh-elu si sculã shi s-dusi dupã nãsu.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Sh-ma nãpoi cãndu Isusul eara la measã la casa al Levi, multsã taxidãri sh-amãrtioshi shidea la measã cu Isusul sh-cu ucenitsilji a lui, cã eara multsã atselji cai njidzea dupã nãsu. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Atumtsea scriblji sh-Fariseilji, cãndu vidzurã cã ma mãca deadun cu taxidarlji shi amãrtioshlji, lã-dzãsirã a ucenitsilor a lui: “Cum mãcã sh-bea elu deadun cu taxidarlji shi amãrtioshlji?” <verse eid="MRK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Sh-Isusul cãndu avdzã, lã-dzãsi a lor: “Nu suntu sãnãtoshlji tsi au ananghi ti doctorlu, ma lãndzitslji. Mini nu vinj s-acljem ndreptsãlji, ma amãrtioshlji trã mitãnjiusiri.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nvitsãtura Atsea Noaua al Isus shi Traditsia Atsea Veacljea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Atumtsea ucenitsilji al Ioan sh-a Fariseilor tsãnea pãreasinji. Atselji vinirã la Isusul sh-lu ntribarã: “Cãtse ucenitsilji al Ioan sh-atselji a Fariseilor tsãnã pãreasinji, sh-ucenitsilji a tãlji nu tsãn pãreasinji?” <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Sh-Isusul lã apãndisi a-lor: “Pot s-tsãnã pãreasinji acljimatsilji pi numtã cãndu dzinirli easti cu elji? Di cãt chiro dzinirli easti cu elji nu pot s-tsãnã pãreasinji! <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Ma va yinã dzãlili cãndu va hibã loatã dzinirli di la elji, sh-atumtsea tu atseali dzãli elji va tsãnã pãreasinji. <verse eid="MRK 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Vãrã nu bagã tu un stranji vecljiu un peatic nou, cã altã soi arupi stranjilu shi azmuldzearea s-fatsi ma mari. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Tutã ashã vãrã nu bagã yin nou tu foali veaclji, altã soi yinlu atsel nou aspardzi foalili, yinlu s-vearsi sh-foalili cher, ashã cã yinlu atsel nou s-bagã tu foali nali.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul, Domnul a Sãmbãtãljei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Sh-undzi tsi unã dzuã di Sãmbãtã elu ma tritsea namisa di agri siminati, shi tricãnda ucenitsilji a lui arupea schicuri. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Sh-Fariseilji lji-dzãsirã: “Vedz, cãtse u facã aestã tsi nu prindi s-u facã dzua di Sãmbãtã?” <verse eid="MRK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Sh-elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Ma nu avets cãntatã tu Scriturili tsi featsi Davidul, cãndu avea ananghi sh-agiuna, elu sh-tuts alantsãlji cai eara cu nãsu? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Elu intrã tu casa al Dumnidzãu tu chirolu a arhipreftlui Abiatar, sh-mãcã pãnjili di bãgari dininti, tsi nu prindi s-li mãca vãrã, dicãt mash preftsãlji, sh-elu lã deadi sh-atsilor tsi eara cu nãsu.” <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Deapoea lã dzãsi a lor: “Sãmbãta easti faptã ti omlu, sh-nu omlu ti Sãmbãta.” <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Trã atsea Hiljilu a Omlui easti Domnu a Sãmbãtãljei.<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Omlu cu Mãna Uscatã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Deapoea elu intrã tu sinagogã, sh-aclo eara un om cu mãna uscatã. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Niscãntsã lu vigljea Isusul macã va vindica dzua di Sãmbãtã, sh-deapoea s-lu vãrghea. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Elu lji-dzãsi a omlui cu mãna uscatã: “Scoalã-ti namisa a tutulor!” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Deapoea lã dzãsi a lor: “Tsi easti ndreptu dzua di Sãmbãtã, s-fats ghini icã s-fats arãu, s-ascachi un suflit icã su-vatsãnji?” Ma elji tãtsea. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Atumtsea elu, cum vidzu anvãrliga cu inati, shi nvirinat cã ininjli a lor eara nchitriti, lji dzãsi a omlui: “Tindi mãna!” Elu u teasi sh-mãna a lui s-featsi ca alanta sãnãtoasã. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Sh-Fariseilji ishirã afoarã shi trãoarã apofãsirã cu Herodianjlji, cum s-lu-vatãmã.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Aleapsi Di Doisprãdzatslji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Isusul cu ucenitsilji a lui s-dusi cãtrã amari sh-unã multsãmi mari di oaminji dit Galilea sh-dit Iudea lu-urmã, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />sh-dit Ierusalem, sh-dit Idumea, sh-di napãrti di Iordan, tutashã unã multsãmi mari di anvãrliga di Tiro sh-di Sidon. Cãndu avdzãrã atseali lucri mãri tsi elu fãtsea, vinirã la nãsu. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Sh-elu lã dzãsi a ucenitsilor a lui s-aibã totãna etimu unã varcã, tsi lumea s-nu-u pindzea. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Elu avea vindicatã multsã oaminji, tuts tsi avea lãngoari s-aduna anvãrliga di nãsu s-bãga mãna pri nãsu. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Shi duhurili atseali nicurati cãndu lu videa cãdea pri dintsi nãintea a lui sh-aurla dzãcãnda: “Tini eshti Hiljiu al Dumnidzãu!” <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Ma elu lji vãrghea tra s-nu aspunea cai eara elu.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Deapoea elu s-alinã pri munti, sh-acljimã aproapi di nãsu atselji tsi vrea. Sh-elji vinirã la nãsu. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Sh-elu aleapsi doisprãdzatsi (tsi s-acljima apostulji), s-hibã cu nãsu shi s-lji pitritsea s-predica, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />shi s-avea puteari s-vindicã dratslji. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Sh-ia doisprãdzatslji: Simonlu, a cui lji bãgã numa Petru, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Iacovul, hiljiu al Zebedeu, sh-Ioan, fratili al Iacov, tsi lã bãgã numa Boanerges, tsi va s-dzãcã hiljilji a bubunidzariljei. <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andrea, Filipu, Bartolomeu, Mateu, Toma, Iacovu, hiljiu al Alfeu, Tadeu, shi Simon Cananeanlu, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />sh-Iuda Iscariotul, tsi ma nãpoi lu vindu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Blãstimarea a Fariseilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Apoea intrarã la unã casã. Shi s-adunã unã multsãmi mari cãt nitsi pãni nu putea s-mãca. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Sh-cãndu soia a lui lo di hãbari, s-dusi su-ljea, cã dzãtsea: “Nu easti ghini di minti.” <verse eid="MRK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Iarã scriblji tsi avea dipunatã dit Ierusalem, dzãtsea: “Elu ari Belzebul sh-lji aĝuneashti dratslji cu printsul a dratsilor.” <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Ma elu li-acljimã aproapi di nãsu shi lã grãi cu parabolã: “Cum poati Satanlu s-aĝuneascã Satanlu? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Macã unã amirãrilji di nãuntru easti mpãrtsãtã, atsea amirãrilji nu poati s-bãneadzã. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Macã unã casã di nãuntru sã-mpartã, atsea casã nu poati s-bãneadzã. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Ashã, macã Satanlu si-scoalã contra a lui idyiul, shi easti mpãrtsãt, nu poati s-tsãnã, ma s-bitiseashti icã cheari. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Vãrã nu-poati s-intrã tu casa a unui om vãrtos shi s-lji-u arãcheascã avearea a lui, ni lãgatã ma nãinti omlu atsel vãrtoslu, atumtsea poati s-lji-u afurã casa. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Dealihea ma vã dzãc cã a oaminjlor va s-lã hibã ljirtati itsi amãrtii shi cathi blãstem tsi va s-dzãcã. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Ma ti atsel tsi va blastimã cãtrã Duhlui Sãmtu nu va aibã ljirtari di totãna. Elu easti amãrtios ti eta tutã.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Isusul li dzãsi aesti cã elji dzãtsea: “Elu ari un duh nicurat!”<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fumealjia al Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Tu oara atsea vinirã fratslji a lui sh-muma, shi stãnda nafoarã, pitricurã sh-lji grirã. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Multsãmea eara apunat anvãrliga di nãsu, sh-lji dzãsirã: “Ia, muma sh-fratslji a tãlji, suntu nafoarã sh-ma ti caftã.” <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Ma elu apãndisi a lor: “Cai easti muma-a mea icã fratslji a melji?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Daepoea, mutrinda anvãrliga di atselji tsi shidea ningã nãsu, dzãsi: “Ia, muma-a mea sh-fratslji-a melji! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Cã, caitsido tsi fatsi vrearea al Dumnidzãu, elu easti fratili-a meu, sora-a mea sh-muma.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Parabola a Siminãtorlui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Deapoea Isusul apãrnji s-nveatsã mardzina di amari. Sh-anvãrliga di nãsu s-adunã un multsãmi mari di oaminji, cãt elu intrã tu varcã shi-shidea pri nãsã, shi tutã multsãmea eara mardzina di amari. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Sh-elu lã nvitsa a lor cu paraboli multi lucruri, shi tu nvitsãtura-a lui lã dzãsi: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Ascultats! Ia, ishi siminãtorlu si seaminã. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Sh-cãndu elu simina, niscãnti gãrnutsi a farãljei cãdzurã pri cali shi puljilji a tserlui vinirã sh-li mãcarã. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Sh-niscãnti gãrnutsi di farã cãdzurã pri loc chitros, iu nu avea multã tsarã shi deadi dinãoarã, cã nu avea tsarã hãndoasã. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Ma cãndu ishi soarili s-pãlirã sh-trã atsea, tsi nu avea arãdãtsinã s-uscarã. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Sh-unã parti a farãljei cãdzu namisa di schinji, schinjilji criscurã, lji acãtsarã anasa sh-nu deadi carpo. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Unã altã parti cãdzu pri tsarã bunã, sh-deadi carpo tsi crishtea sh-adusi: unã treidzãtsi, alanta shaidzãtsi, sh-alanta unã sutã.” <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Deapoea elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Cai ari ureclji trã avdzãri, s-avdã.”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Cãndu Isusul eara singur, atselji tsi eara avãrliga di nãsu deadun cu doisprãdzatslji, lu ntribarã ti parabola. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Elu lã dzãsi a lor: “A voauã vã easti datã s-cunushtets mistiryiul a amirãriljei al Dumnidzãu, iarã atsilor tsi suntu afoarã tuti aesti lã si da cu paraboli:<verse eid="MRK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />
    <char style="it">‘Mutrinda, s-mutreascã ma s-nu veadã,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="it">shi avdzãnda, s-avdã ma s-nu aducheascã,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="it">tra nu s-mitãnjiuseascã</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="it">shi amãrtiili s-ljeartã.’</char>”<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aduchearea a Parabolãljei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Deapoea lã dzãsi a lor: “Nu u-aduchits aestã parabolã? Ma atumtsea cum va li aduchits tuti alanti paraboli? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Siminãtorlu seaminã Zborlu. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Atselji ningã cali suntu atselji pri la cai si seaminã zborlu, ma dupã tsi lu avdzãrã, yini trãoarã Satanlu shi lã-ljea zborlu siminatã la nãshi. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Tutashã atselji tsi suntu siminati fara pri chetri, suntu atselji tsi cãndu lu avdzãrã zborlu, trãoarã lu ljea cu harauã, <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />ma nu acãtsarã arãdãtsinã pri nãshi, shi suntu ti putsãn chiro, shi cãndu yini zorea icã avinarea trã itia a-zborlui, si-cicãrdisescu trãoarã. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Atselji cai si seaminã namisa di scinji, suntu atselji tsi lu-ascultã zborlu, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />ma nvirinãrili-a aishtei eti, arãdearili-a avearilor, shi mania ti alti lucri tsi lji intrã a omlui, astupu zborlu shi nu da carpo. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Iarã atselji tsi si siminarã tu tsarã bunã, suntu atselji tsi ascultã zborlu, u ljea shi aducã carpo: un treidzãtsi, altu shaidzãtsi shi altu unã sutã.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Parabola a Cãndilãljei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Deapoea lã dzãsi a lor: “Vahi s-bagã cãndila sum unã gãleatã icã sum un pat? Nu s-bagã pri purtãtorul a lunjinãljei? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Cã nu ari tsiva ascumtu tsi s-nu s-dizvãleascã, shi tsiva faptu pri ascumtu tsi s-nu easã tu lunjinã. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Cai ari ureclji ti avdzãri, s-avdã!” <verse eid="MRK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Shi lã dzãsi a lor: “Bãgats oarã atsea tsi avdzãts. Cu atsea mizurã tsi voi misurats, va vã si misurã, shi a voauã tsi avdzãts va vã si da ma multu. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Cã atsilui tsi ari va lji si da, ma atsilui tsi nu ari va lji si ljea shi atsea tsi ari.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Parabola a Simintsãljei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Isusul dzãsi: “Amirãriljea al Dumnidzãu easti ca un om tsi arucã simintsa pri loc. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Noaptea shi dzua, cãndu elu doarmi shi si scoalã, simintsa fitruseashti shi creashti, fãrã si shtibã elu cum. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Di singur loclu lu fatsi: ma nãinti curpanlu, sh-apoea schiclu, shi tu soni schiclu cu gãrnutsi. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Iarã cãndu carpolu s-coapsi, trãoarã s-bagã seatsira, cã yini oara di sitsirari.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Parabola a Simintsãljei di Sinap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Elu dzãsi: “Cu tsi undzeashti amirãriljea al Dumnidzãu? Icã cu tsi parabolã su-aspunem? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Ea undzeashti cu simintsa di sinap tsi easti siminat tu loc. Atsea simintsã easti ma njica pri loc. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Ma dupã tsi si seaminã, creashti shi s-fatsi ma mari di tuti zãrzãvãtsili, shi sãlãgheashti dedzi ahãnti mãri cãt puljilji a tserlui pot s-aflã streahã sum aumbra a lor.” <verse eid="MRK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Shi cu multi ahtãri paraboli lã aspunea a lor zborlu, ashã cum elji putea s-lu achicãsea. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Sh-nu lã grea a lor fãrã paraboli, iarã a ucenitsilor a lui dinãparti lã spunea itsido.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul shi Furtuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Tu seara a dzuãljei aishtei, lã dzãsi a lor: “Tritsem pri alantã parti.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Sh-ucenitsilji, cum u nchisirã multsãmea, lu loarã Isusul ashã cum eara tu varcã. Cu nãsu eara sh-niscãnti vãrtsi njitsi. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Tu oarã aestã s-featsi unã furtunã mari shi vãljurili s-plãscãnea pri varcã ahãntã multã cãt ea ma s-umplea. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Iarã elu durnjea tu varcã pri un cãpitinj, elji lu dishtiptarã shi lji dzãsirã: “Nvitsãtore nu ai mirachi trã noi cã ma ni nicãm?” <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Sh-elu cum si dishtiptã lji aurlã a vimtului sh-lji gãri ali amari: “Tãtsi shi pãpsea!” Shi vimtul pãpsi shi s-featsi tãtseari mari. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Sh-lã dzãsi a lor: “Cãtse hits fricoshi? Cum nu avets pisti?” <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Sh-elji lji acãtsã unã fricã mari shi dzãtsea cu un-alantu: “Cai easti aestu tsi lu ascultã sh-vimtul sh-amarea?”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Demonizatul Gadarean</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Ashã agiumsirã tu alantã parti a amariljei tu locurili a Gherasenjilor. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Shi macãt Isusul dipunã dit varcã, trãoarã lji ishi nãinti dit murmintsã<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">murmintsã </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Easti una guvã tãljeat tu cheatrã, iu Iudeilji li bãga mortsãlji a lor.</char></note> un om umplut cu un duh nicurat, <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />elu bãna tu murmintsã sh-vãrã nu avea putut s-lu liga cu singir. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Di multi ori lu avea ligatã cu prãnghi shi singir, ma elu totãna frãndzea singirili sh-arupea prãnghili, sh-nitsiunu nu putea s-lu imireadzã. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Dipriunã noaptea sh-dzua, prit murmintsã sh-prit muntsã, tritsea aurlãnda shi tãljãnda truplu a lui cu chetri. <verse eid="MRK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Cãndu elu lu vidzu Isusul di diparti, imnã shi s-ncljinã nãintea a lui. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Sh-cu unã aurlari mari dzãsi: “Tsi ari namisa di mini sh-di tini, Isus, Hiljilu al Dumnidzãu atsel multu analtu? Mini mi spigiurã pri numa al Dumnidzãu, nu mi munduea!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Cã Isusul lji-avea dzãsã: “Duh nicurat, eshi dit aestu om!” <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Atumtsea Isusul lu ntribã: “Cai easti numa a ta?” Shi elu apãndisi dzãcãnda: “Mini mi acljeamã Leghion, cã him multsã.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Sh-multu lji fãtsea rigeai tra s-nu lu aĝuneascã dit loclu atsel. <verse eid="MRK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Aclo la coasta a muntilui eara unã cupii mari di portsi tsi pãshtea. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Atumtsea tuts demonjlji s-rugarã dzãcãndã: “Pitreatsi-nã la portsi tra s-intrãm tu nãshi.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Sh-Isusul trãoarã lã deadi volje a lor, sh-duhurili nicurati dupã tsi ishirã, intrarã la portslji, sh-cupia s-arcã nghios di tu ripã tu amari. Era aproapi doauã njilji di capiti tsi s-nicarã tu amari.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Atselji tsi pãshtea portslji fudzirã sh-u scurpisirã hãbarea tu cãsãbã sh-pri hoari. Sh-oaminjlji vinirã s-videa tsi avea undzitã. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Cãndu vinirã la Isusul, vidzurã demonizatlu mpadi, nviscut sh-cu mintea ntreag, atsel tsi avea leghionlu, shi avurã fricã. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Atselji tsi lu avea vidzutã, lji spusirã a lor cã tsi lji avea undzitã a demonizatlui shi a portsilor. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Atumtsea atselji ahurhirã s-lji fac rigeai al Isus s-fugã di sinurili a lor. <verse eid="MRK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Cãndu elu ma intra tu varcã, atsel tsi eara demonizat lji si ruga tra s-putea s fudzea cu nãsu. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Ma Isusul nu lji deadi volje, sh-lji dzãsi: “Imnã la casa a ta, la-a tãlji shi aspunã a-lor tsi lucri mãri featsi Domnul shi cum ti njilui.” <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Sh-elu fudzi shi ahurhi s-predica pri locurili di Decapolis trã tuti atseali tsi avea faptã Isusul shi tuts s-ciudisirã.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muljearea cu Curarea a Sãndzilui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Shi cãndu Isusul tricu nãpoi tu alantã parti cu varcã, unã multsãmi mari s-adunã anvãrliga di nãsu, sh-elu armasi mardzina di amari. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Deapoea vini un di ma mãrlji a sinagogãljei, cu numa Iair, tsi cãndu lu vidzu, lj-cãdzu la cicioari. <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />Sh-multu lji-si ruga dzãcãnda: “Hiljea a mea ma moari, haidi shi bagã mãnjili pri nãsã, tra s-vindicã shi s-bãneadzã.” <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Sh-elu s-dusi cu nãsu, sh-unã multsãmi mari njidzea dupã nãsu shi s-pindzea anvãrliga di nãsu. <verse eid="MRK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Namisa di nãshi eara unã muljeari tsi lj-cura sãndzili di doisprãdzatsi di anji. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Sh-avea traptã multi di partea a doctorlor sh-avea chirutã tutã avearea a ljei ni fãrã di ufelii, sh-ma s-fãtsea ma arãu. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Cãndu avdzã si zbura di Isusul, intrã la multsãmea sh-di pri dupã plãtãri timsi mãna la stranjilu al Isus. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Ea dzãtsea: “Macã va bagã mãna la stranjili a lui, va mi vindicã.” <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Sh-trãoarã curarea a sãndzilui pãpsi shi ea sãmtsã tu truplu a ljei cã s-vindicã di atsea lãngoari. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Ma trãoarã Isusul sãmtsã un puteari tsi avea ishit di la nãsu, s-turnã cãtrã multsãmea sh-dzãsi: “Cai deadi di stranjili a meali?” <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Sh-ucenitsilji a lui lji-dzãsirã: “Nu vedz cã multsãmea ma s-pindzi di tuti pãrtsãli shi tini dzãtsi: ‘Cai deadi di mini?’” <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Elu mutrea anvãrliga s-videa cai u featsi aestã. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Atumtsea, muljearea mplinã di fricã sh-trimurãnda, cã shtia tsi avea pãtsãtã, vini sh-lji cãdzu pri cicioari sh-lji aspusi tutã alihea. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Sh-elu lj-dzãsi: “Hilje, pistea a ta ti-vindicã, imnã tu pace cã eshti vindicatã di lãngoarea a ta!”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hiljea al Iair</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Iarã Isusul ninga ma grea, vinirã niscãntsã di la casa a primarlui a sinagogãljei dzãcãndã: “Hiljea a ta muri. Cãtse lu cãrteshti ninga nvitsãtorlu?” <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Ma Isusul cãndu avdzã zboarili tsi s-dzãsirã, lji dzãsi a primarlui a sinagogãljei: “Nu ti aspari, mash pistipsea!” <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Nu alãsã s-lu urmeadzã vãrã altã, dicãt mash Petrul, Iacovul shi Ioanul, fratili al Iacov. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Shi dupã cum agiumsi la casa a primarlui a sinagogãljei, vidzu unã mintiturã mari shi oaminji tsi plãndzea shi vãita cu boatsi. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Intrã sh-lã dzãsi a lor: “Cãtse aurlats shi plãndzets? Feata nu muri, ma doarmi.” <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Elji s-pizuirã, ma elu dupã tsi lji scoasi tuts nafoarã, lo cu nãsu tat-su shi mã-sa ali feati sh-atselji tsi eara cu nãsã, sh-intrã aclo iu eara feata. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Elu u lo feata di mãnã sh-lji dzãsi: “Talitha cumi”, tsi va s-dzãcã: “Featã, a tsãia ma tsã-dzãc: Scoalã-ti!” <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Trãoarã feata si sculã sh-imnã singur. Ea eara di doisprãdzatsi di anji. Sh-elji s-ciudisirã multu. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Ma elu lã deadi ordin tsi vãrã s-nu shtibã. Sh-lã ursi si lj-da ali feati ti mãcari.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Isusul Ni-aprucheat tu Nazaret</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Apoea Isusul fudzi di aclo sh-vini tu tsara a lui, shi ucenitsilji a lui u urmarã. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Cãndu vini Sãmbãta, ahurhi sã li nvitsa tu sinagogã. Sh-multsã cãndu lu-avdza, s-ciudisea sh-dzãtsea: “Di iu lj-yinã aishtui aesti? Tsi mintimenilji easti atsea tsi lj-easti datã? Sh-cum s-facã aesti thavmati cu mãnjili a lui? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Nu easti aestu lemnar, hiljilu ali Marii, fratili al Iacov, sh-al Iose, al Iuda sh-al Simon? Sh-nu suntu aoa namisa di noi surãrili a lui?” Shi si scandalizea di itia a lui. <verse eid="MRK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Vãrã prufit nu easti dispretsuit dicãt mash tu patria a lui, tu soia a lui sh-tu casa a lui.” <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Sh-nu putu s-facã atsia nitsi-unã thavmã, dicãt mash s-vindicã vãrã-ndoi lãndzitsã bãgãnda mãna pri nãshi. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Shi s-ciudisea ti nipistipsirea a lor. Isusul imna anvãrliga pri hoarili dianvãrliga sh-lã-nvitsa.<verse eid="MRK 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Misionul a Doisprãdzatsilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Sh-lã acljimã atselji doisprãdzatsi sh-ahurhi s-lji pitreacã doi cãti doi sh-lã deadi puteari pristi duhurili nicurati. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Sh-lã dimãndã s-nu ljea tsiva altã pri cali, dicãt mash unã ciumagã, nitsi trastã, nitsi pãni, nitsi pãradz tu brãn, <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Ma s-ncalcã mash sandalili shi s-nu bagã doauã pãreaclji di tunicã. <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Deapoea lã dzãsi: “Iutsido tsi s-intrats tu unã casã, armãnets aclo pãnã s-fudzits di aclo. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Macã niscãntsã nu vã ashteaptã sh-nu vã avdã, cãndu s-fudzits di aclo, ascuturats puhlu di cicioarili-a voastri, ca mãrtirii contra-a lor. [Dealihea vã dzãc cã dzua a giudicatãljei Sodom sh-Gomora va si s-veadã cu ma multã lishuredzi dicãt atsel cãsãbã.]”<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Ashã atselji s-dusirã sh-predica a oaminjlor tsi s-mitãnjiuseascã <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Sh-aĝunea multsã demonji sh-aundzea cu untulem multsã lãndzits sh-li vindica.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moartea al Ioan Pãtidzãtorlu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Tora amirãlu Herod avdzã si zbura di Isusul cã numa a lui eara faptã cunuscut sh-elu dzãsi: “Ioan pãtidzãtorlu s-nyie dit mortsã, trã atsea pri nãsu ma lucreadzã putearili cu mari ciudii.” <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Niscãntsã altsã dzãtsea: “Easti Elia.” Sh-niscãntsã altsã dzãtsea: “Easti un prufit icã un di prufitsilji.” <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Ma cãndu Herodul avdzã tuti atseali, dzãsi: “Ioanlu, a cui lji tãljai caplu, s-nyie dit mortsã!” <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Cã Herodul avea datã ordin s-acãtsa Ioanul shi s-tsãnea ligatã tu hapsi di itia a Herodiadãljei, muljearea al Filip, fratili a lui, cã lu avea loatã ti muljeari. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Ioanlu lj-dzãtsea al Herod: “Nu ai ndriptati s-ljeai muljearea a fratilui a tãu.” <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Herodiada lu aura sh-vrea s-lu vãtãma, ma nu putea. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Herodul s-afirea di Ioanlu tsi lu cunushtea ca om ndreptu shi sãmtu, sh-lu apãra sh-dupã tsi avdza multi lucri ti nãsu, fãtsea multi lucri, sh-lu asculta cu vreari. <verse eid="MRK 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Ma vini dzua tsi lipsea shi Herodul, tu dzua a amintariljei a lui adrã uspetsi ti mãrlji a lui, cãpitãnjilji sh-tinjisitslji a Galileiljei. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Intrã hiljea a Herodiadãljei, giucã sh-lji arãsi al Herod shi a lor tsi shidea deadun cu nãsu la measã, atumtsea amirãlu lji-dzãsi a featiljei: “Caftã-nji itsi vrei shi mini va ts-u dau.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Sh-lji si spigiurã: “Itsido tsi va nji caftsã va tsã dau, pãnã la giumitatea a amirãriljei-a mea.” <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Ea ishi afoarã sh-lji dzãsi a mumãljei: “Tsi prindi s-lji caftu?” Shi ea apãndisi: “Caplu al Ioan Pãtidzãtorlu!” <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Ea s-turnã trãoarã la amirãlu sh-lji-cãftã aĝonjea: “Mini voi tsi tini s-nji dai trãoarã tu tãpsii caplu al Ioan Pãtidzãtorlu.” <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Sh-amirãlu cu tutã cã si nvirinã multu di aestã, nu vrea s-arnisea ti itia cã eara spigiuratã sh-ti tinjia a acljimatslor. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Ashã trãoarã amirãlu pitricu un vigljitor s-lji aducã caplu al Ioan. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Shi elu s-dusi tu hapsi, lj-tãlje caplu sh-lji lu-adusi pri unã tãpsii, lji lu deadi ali feati shi feata lji lu deadi a mumãljei. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Cãndu ucenitsilji al Ioan avdzãrã aesti, vinirã, loarã truplu a lui shi lu bãgarã tu murmintu.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Multsirea di Prota a Pãnjilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Tora apostulji s-adunarã ningã Isusul shi lji spusirã tuti atseali tsi avea faptã shi tsi avea nvitsatã. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Sh-elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Haidets tu un loc tu irnjii sh-discurmats-vã.” Cã oaminjlji tsi yinea shi s-dutsea eara ahãntsã multsã sh-nu avea chiro ti mãcari.<verse eid="MRK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />S-nchisirã cu unã varcã cãtrã un loc ermu shi dipãrtat. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Macãt multsãmea lã vidzu tsi s-nchisirã, multsã di atselji lu cunuscurã, sh-di tuti cãsãbadzli vinirã aclo pri cicioari shi agiumsirã ma nãinti di elji shi s-adunarã anvãrliga di nãsu. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Cãndu Isusul ishi dit varcã, vidzu unã multsãmi mari shi lj-vini arãu, cã era ca oili fãrã picurar. Shi ahurhi s-lã nveatsã multi lucri. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Shi cum tricu multu chiro, ucenitsilji a lui s-apruchearã sh-lji-dzãsirã: “Aestu loc easti ermu sh-tora easti amãnatã. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Dã-lã cali aishtor oaminji si s-ducã tu cãmpurili sh-hoarili di anvãrliga tsi s-acumpãrã pãni, cã nu au tsiva ti mãcari.” <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Iarã elu apãndisinda lã dzãsi a lor: “Dats-lã voi s-mãcã!” Sh-elji lji-dzãsirã: “Prindi s-nidzem noi s-acumpãrãm doauã sutã di denari<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">200 di denari easti ma putsãn di plãtirea a unui an.</char></note> pãni shi s-lã dãm ti mãcari?” <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Cãti pãnji avets? Imnats sh-mutrits!” Dupã tsi vidzurã dzãsirã: “Tsintsi pãnji sh-doi peshti.” <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Atumtsea elu deadi ordin a lor tsi s-lji ndreagã tuts, apunats grupi-grupi pri veardea iarbã. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Ashã atselji s-apunarã tu grupi cãti unã sutã sh-cãti tsindzãtsi. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Apoea elu lo tsintsi pãnjili sh-doi peshtilji, sculã ocljilji cãtrã tser, ghinicuvãntãnda, pãrtsã pãnjili sh-li deadi a ucenitsilor a lui, tra s-li pãrtsa a lor, tutashã lji pãrtsã a lor sh-peshtilji. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Tuts mãcarã shi s-fãnãtirã <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Sh-adunarã doisprãdzatsi di cãneastri cu sãrmi di pãnji shi cu armãsãturi di peshti. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Atselji tsi mãcarã pãnjili eara tsintsi njilji di bãrbats.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Imnã Pristi Apã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Trãoarã Isusul lã ursi ucenitsilji a lui s-intra tu varcã shi s-ducã tu alantã parti cãtrã Betsaida, pãnã-cãndu elu s-alãsa multsãmea s-dispãrta. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Macãt li salutã, elu s-alinã tu munti ti rugari.<verse eid="MRK 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Cãndu tunicã varca eara namisa di amari sh-elu singur eara tu meal. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Cãndu lji vidzu ucenitsilji, elji ma s-cupãsea nãftãnda, cã vimtul eara contra lor. Tu a patrul vigljitor a noaptiljei Isusul s-nchisi cãtrã nãshi imnãnda pri amari sh-elu vrea s-lji tritsea. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Ma elji, cãndu lu-vidzurã cã ma tritsea pri amari, minduirã cã eara unã fantazmã shi ahurhirã s-aurlã. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Tuts lu vidzurã shi s-lãhtãrsirã, ma elu trãoarã ahurhi s-greascã cu nãshi, sh-dzãsi: “Curaiu! Mini escu, nu vã-aspãrats!” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Deapoea s-alinã tu varcã cu nãshi sh-vimtul pãpsi. Sh-atselji armasirã ciudisits shi si thãvmãtisirã. <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Cã nu lu-avea aduchitã thavma a pãnjilor cã inima a lor eara nchitritã. <verse eid="MRK 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Dupã tsi tricurã, agiumsirã tu loclu a Ghenezaretlui, sh-aclo lu-ligarã varca. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Sh-cãndu ishirã dit varcã, oaminjlji lu-cunuscurã dinãoarã. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Shi tricãnda trãoarã pri tuti locurili di anvãrligã, ahurhirã s-aducã tuts lãndzitslji pri paturi iutsido tsi avdza cã s-afla elu. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Iutsido tsi elu intra, tu hoari, tu cãsãbadz icã tu mãhãladz oaminjlji bãga lãndzitslji tu padi, sh-lji si ruga tra s-bãga mãna pi stranjili a lui. Sh-tuts atselji tsi bãgarã mãna s-vindicarã.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Nvitsarea ti Cãtãrisiri di Nãuntru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Atumtsea s-adunarã anvãrliga di nãsu Fariseilji shi niscãntsã scribi tsi avea vinitã di Ierusalem. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Atselji bãgarã oarã cã niscãntsã di ucenitsilji a lui ma mãca pãni cu mãnjili nicurati, va s-dzãcã niaspilati. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Fariseilji sh-tuts Iudeilji nu mãcã niaspilati ghini mãnjili ma nãinti, tsãnãnda adetsili a vecljilor. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Sh-cãndu s-toarnã dit pãzari nu mãcã macã nu suntu aspilats ma nãinti. Suntu multi alti lucri tsi atselji prindi s-li fac trã itia a adetsilor: aspilarea a cupilor, a pocilor, a cãldãrilor shi a paturilor.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Deapoea Fariseilji shi scriblji lu ntribarã: “Cãtse ucenitsilji a tãlji nu facã dupã adetsili a vecljilor, ma mãcã pãni ni aspilati mãnjili?” <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Ma elu apãndisinda lã dzãsi a lor: “Ghini prufitipsi Isaia trã voi, ipucrits, ashã cum easti scriatã:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">
    <char style="it">‘Aestu popul cu budzãli mi tinjiseashti,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">
    <char style="it">ma inima-a lor easti diparti di mini.</char><verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />
    <char style="it">Ma digeaba mi alãvdats,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">
    <char style="it">nvitsãnda unã nvitsãturã tsi easti unã Dimãndãciunji umineascã.’</char><verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Alãsãnda di unã parti ordinlu al Dumnidzãu, ma tsãnets adetsili a oaminjlor, aspilarea a pocilor sh-a cupilor, shi fãtsets multi alti ahtãri lucri.” <verse eid="MRK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Sh-ninga lã dzãsi a lor: “Voi hits axii ti arnisiri ordinlu al Dumnidzãu, sh-ti tsãneari adetea a voastrã. <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Moisiul dzãsi: <char style="it">‘Tinjisea tatãl a tãu sh-muma a ta.’</char> Shi: <char style="it">‘Atsel tsi blastimã tatãl sh-muma, easti giudicatã cu moarti.’</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Ma voi dzãtsets: ‘Macã vãrã lji-dzãtsi a-tatãlui a lui icã a mumãljei a lui, itsi pot s-facã trã voi easti un Curban, va s-dzãcã un pisches trã Dumnidzãlu,’ <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />nu lu alãsats atsel s-facã tsiva di tatãl a lui icã di muma a lui, <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />ashã voi arnisits zborlu al Dumnidzãu cu adetea a voastrã, tsi voi u-avets mushtinatã. Shi voi ma fãtsets multi alti ahtãri lucri.” <verse eid="MRK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Deapoea acljimã tutã lumea anvãrliga di nãsu shi lji-dzãsi: “Mi ascultats tuts shi aduchits! <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Nu ari tsiva di nafoarã a omlui, tsi intrãnda tu nãsu s-u lãvusheascã, aljumtrea, suntu atseali lucri tsi easã di la nãsu tsi u lãvushescu.” <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />[Cai ari ureclji trã avdzãri, s-avdã!]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aestu stih nu s-aflã tu itsi manuscrisi gãrtseascã.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Ma napoea, cãndu elu s-turnã la casã, diparti di multsãmea, ucenitsilji a lui lu-ntribarã trã achicãsirea a parabolãljei. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Sh-elu lã-dzãsi a lor: “Sh-voi nu avets minti n-capã. Nu-u aduchitsã cã itsi intrã di nafoarã la omlu nu poati s-u lãvusheascã? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Cã nu lji-intrã tu inimã, ma tu pãnticã, sh-deapoea easi nafoarã tu tualet?” Zburãnda ashã, elu li dimãndã curati tuti mãcãrili.<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Elu dzãsi: “Atsea tsi easi di la omlu, u-fatsi lãvos. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Cã di nãuntru, va s-dzãcã dit inima a-omlui es minduirili arali, ncãlcarea a curuniljei, furãrili, vãtãmãrili, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />putãnsirili, mãniili, ruteatsili, arãdearili, arushinarea, pizma, blãstemlu, pirifanea, hãzãmãrili. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Tuti atseali arali es di nãuntru sh-u lãvushescu omlu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muljearea Siro-Fenicianã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Deapoea s-nchisi di aclo shi s-dusi tu cãsãbãlu a Tirlui. Intrã tu unã casã sh-vrea tsi vãrã s-nu shtibã, ma nu putu s-armãnã ascumtu. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Unã muljeari, tsi hiljea a ljei avea un duh nicuratã, avdzãnda di Isusul, vini sh-cãdzu la cicioarili a lui. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Tora atsea muljeari eara elinã, cu arãdãtsinã Sirofenicã. Shi lji si rugã a lui tsi s-lu aĝunea draclu di hiljea a ljei. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Iarã Isusul dzãsi: “Alasã cilimenjlji<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">cilimenjlji </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vrea s-dzãc cilimenjlji a Israelui, shi cãtsãlji a cãnjilor va s-dzãc nu-Iudeilji.</char></note> prota s-fãnãteascã, cã nu easti ghini s-ljeai pãnea a-cilimenjilor shi s-u arutsã a cãtsãljilor.” <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Ma ea apãndisi shi lj-dzãsi: “Ghini ma greshti, Doamne, ma shi cãtsãljilji sum measã mãcã sãrmili a cilimenjilor!” <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Atumtsea elu lj-dzãsi: “Trã aestu zbor a tãu, fudz, draclu ishi di hiljea a-ta!” <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Sh-ea, cãndu s-turnã la casa a-ljei, u-aflã feata tu pat shi draclu avea ishitã.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Vindicarea a unui Surd-Mut di Decapolis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Dupã tsi s-nchisi nãpoi dit locurili a Tirlui shi s-dusi cãtrã Sidon, Isusul agiumsi la amarea a Galileiljei, namisa di loclu di Decapolis. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Sh-lji adusirã un mut tsi cu zori grea, shi lji si rugarã s-bagã mãnjili pri nãsu s-lu vindica.<verse eid="MRK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Cum lu lo, diparti dit multsãmea, lj-bãgã dzeaditli tu urecljili a lui, shi dupã tsi scuche dzeaditlu, lj-acãtsã limba. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Deapoea sculã ocljilji cãtrã tser, suschirã shi-lj dzãsi: “Effatha”, tsi va s-dzãcã: “Discljidi-ti!” <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Shi trãoarã s-discljisirã urecljili shi s-dizligã gura sh-elu grãi cum prindi.<verse eid="MRK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Sh-Isusul lã-ursi atselji tsi s-nu lji aspunea a vãrui. Ma cu cãt ma multu lã ursea ahtãt ma multu elji lu scurpisea zborlu. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Sh-multu ciudisits, dzãtsea: “Elu itsido lu ari faptã ghini, tsi surdzãlji s-avdã sh-mutsilji s-greascã!”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Multsirea a Doaua a Pãnjilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Tu atseali dzãli, s-adunã unã multsãmi multu mari sh-nu avea tsi s-mãca, Isusul lã-grãi a ucenitsilor sh-lã dzãsi a lor: <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Nj-easti njilã di aestã multsãmi, cã s-featsirã trei dzãli tsi sta cu mini, sh-nu ari tsi s-mãcã. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Sh-ma s-lji pitrecu la casã ni mãcat, va-s armãnã pi cali, cã niscãntsã di elji au vinit di diparti.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Sh-ucenitsilji a lui lj-apãndisirã: “Cum va lji fãntea vãrã cu pãni aeshti aoa tu irnjii?” <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Sh-elu lji-ntribã: “Cãti pãnji avets?” Elji dzãsirã: “Shapti.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Atumtsea elu lã-deadi ordin ali multsãmi s-apunã mpadi. Sh-lo shapti pãnjili, hãristisi, li-frãmsi shi li-deadi a ucenitsilor a-lui tsi s-li mpãrtsa ali multsãmi, sh-elji li pãrtsarã. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Avea sh-niscãnti peshti njitsi. Dupã tsi li-ghinicuvãntã, ordinã tsi sh-atselji s-lji mpãrtsa la multsãmea. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Ashã elji mãcarã shi s-fãnãtirã, sh-adunarã shapti coshuri cu bucãtsili tsi armasirã. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Atselji tsi mãcarã eara vãrã patru njilji di oaminji, deapoea lji sãlãghi tra s-fugã.<verse eid="MRK 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nvitsãtura a Fariseilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Elu trãoarã intrã tu varcã cu ucenitsilji a lui shi s-dusi tu locurili a-Dalmanutiljei. <verse eid="MRK 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Vinirã Fariseilji shi apãrnjirã si zbura cu nãsu, cãftãnda un semnu dit tser tra s-lu bãga tu provã. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Elu suschirãnda dzãsi: “Cãtse aestã gheneratã caftã semnu? Dealihea ma vã dzãc cã a farãljei aishtei nu-va lji si da vãrã semnu.” <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Sh-alãsãnda-lji, intrã napoi tu varcã shi tricu di napãrti.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Ucenitsilji avea agãrshit s-ljea pãni, sh-tu varcã nu-avea tsiva dicãt mash unã singur pãni. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Isusul lã-vãrghi dzãcãnda: “S-avets cãshtiga, afirits-vã di maeaua a Fariseilor sh-di maeaua al Herodul!” <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Ma elji minduia namisa di nãshi, dzãcãnda: “Nu avem pãni.” <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Isusul bãgã oarã sh-lã-dzãsi: “Cãtse minduits cã nu avets pãni? Ninga nu avets achicãsitã sh-nu avets aduchitã? Ninga u-avets inima nchitritã? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Avets oclji sh-nu videts, avets ureclji sh-nu-avdzãts? Nu tsãnets minti? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Cãndu mpãrtsai tsintsi pãnjili ti tsintsi njilji, cãti coshuri mplini cu bãcãtsi adunat?” Elji dzãsirã: “Doisprãdzatsi.” <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />“Cãndu mpãrtsai shaptili pãnji ti patru njilji, cãti coshuri mplini cu pãnji adunatã?” Elji dsãsirã: “Shapti.” <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Sh-elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Ma cum ninga nu achicãsits?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Vindicarea a Orbului dit Betsaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Deapoea agiumsi tu Betsaida sh-lji adusirã un orbu sh-lji si rugarã s-bagã mãna. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Atumtsea lo di mãnã orbul, lu scoasi nafoarã dit hoarã, shi dupã tsi lji-scuche tu oclji shi bãgã mãnjili pri nãsu, lu-ntribã macã videa tsiva. <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Sh-elu, discljisi ocljilji sh-dzãsi: “Ma ved oaminji ca ponji tsi imnã.” <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Sh-Isusul lã bãgã mãnjili napoi pristi ocljilji a lui sh-lji dzãsi s-veadã cãtrã nsus, shi atsilui lji si turnã videarea sh-videa ghini itsido. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Sh-Isusul lu-pitricu s-ducã la-casa a lui dzãcãnda: “Nu intrã tu hoarã sh-nu lji aspunã a vãrui tsiva.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mãrtiria a Petrului</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Deapoea Isusul s-dusi deadun cu ucenitsilji a lui tu hoarili a Cezareljei al Filip. Sh-tu cali lã-ntribã ucenitsilji a lui dzãcãndã: “Cai dzãc oaminjlji cã escu mini?” <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Elji apãndisirã: “Niscãntsã dzãc Ioan Pãtidzãtorlu, altsã Elia, sh-altsãlji un dit prufitsilji.” <verse eid="MRK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Sh-elu lã-dzãsi a lor: “Ma voi, cai dzãtsets cã escu?” Sh-Petrul apãndisinda lji-dzãsi: “Tini eshti Hristolu.” <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Atumtsea elu lã ursi s-nu aspunea a vãrui ti nãsu. <verse eid="MRK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Deapoea Isusul apãrnji s-lã nveatsã a lor cã Hiljilu a-Omlui prindi s-mundueascã di multi lucri, shi va-si s-aleapid di aushlji, di ma mãrlji a-preftsãlor sh-di scriblji, cã va s vatãmã shi dupã trei dzãli va s-nyeadzã. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Sh-elu lã dzãsi aesti zboari pri fatsã. Atumtsea Petrul lu lo dinãparti sh-apãrnji s-lu vãrgheascã. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Ma elu s-turnã, vidzu ucenitsilji a lui sh-lji aurlã a Petrului dzãcãnda: “Fudz di la mini, drac, cã tini nu ai minti ti lucrili al Dumnidzãu, ma ti lucrili a-oaminjlor.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cathiun s-ljea Crutsea a Lui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Sh-acljimã ningã nãsu multsãmea cu ucenitsilji a lui, sh-lã dzãsi: “Cathiunu tsi va yinã dupã mini, s-aleapid bana a lui, s-ljea crutsea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:34 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">s-ljea crutsea </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Va s-dzãc s-hii etimu s-ti mundueshti shi s-mori urmãnda Hristolu.</char></note> a lui, shi s-mi urmeadzã. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Cã atsel tsi va s-ascapã bana a lui, va su-chearã, ma atsel tsi va-u chearã bana a lui trã itia a mea sh-ti evanghelu, va s-ascapã. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Tsi hãiri va s-aibã omlu s-amintã ntreagã lumea, macã deapoea va s-chearã suflitlu a lui? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Icã tsi poati s-da omlu tu alãxirea a suflitlui a lui? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Cã a cathiunui tsi va-lji yinã arushini trã mini sh-trã zboarili a meali namisa di aestã gheneratã curunã-cãlcatã shi amãrtioasã, trã atsea va lj-yinã arushini sh-a Hiljilui a Omlui, cãndu s-agiungã la mãrirea a Tatãlui a lui, cu anghilji sãmtsã.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Deapoea Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Dealihea vã-dzãc cã namisa di voi tsi hits aoa suntu niscãntsã tsi nu-va u gusteadzã moartea ma nãinti tsi s-veadã cã va yinã cu puteari amirãriljea al Dumnidzãu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fãnirusirea al Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Dupã shasi dzãli Isusul lo cu nãsu Petrul, Iacovul sh-Ioanul sh-lji dusi dinãparti, singur atselji pri un munti analtu. Shi s-alãxi nãintea a lor. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Shi stranjili a lui si strãlutsirã shi s-featsirã albi ca neaua, ashã cum nu poati s-li alãgheascã vãrã alghitor pri loc. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Sh-a lor lã si fãniurisi Elia cu Moisiu tsi ma zbura cu Isusul. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Atumtsea lo zborlu Petrul sh-lji dzãsi al Isus: “Nvitsãtore, trã noi easti ghini s-him aoa, s-adrãm trei tendi, unã trã tini, unã trã Moisiu shi unã trã Elia!” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Elu nu-shtia tsi s-dzãtsea, cã elji eara aspãrats.<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Deapoea vini un nior tsi lã anvãli cu aumbra a lui, sh-dit nior ishi unã boatsi tsi dzãsi: “Aestu easti Hiljilu a meu vrut! Ascultats-lu!” <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Shi trãoarã elji vidzurã anvãrliga, ma nu vidzurã vãrã, dicãt singur Isusul cu nãshi. <verse eid="MRK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Tora cãndu ma dipuna dit munti, Isusul lã-ordinã s-nu aspunã a vãrui lucrili tsi avea vidzut, pãnã-cãndu Hiljilu a-Omlui s-nyeadzã dit mortsã. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Elji lu tsãnurã zborlu shi ntriba un-alantu cã tsi va s-dzãtsea s-nyeadzã dit mortsã. <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Deapoea lu ntribarã dzãcãnda: “Cãtse scriblji dzãc cã ma nãinti prindi s-yinã Elia?” <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Sh-elu, apãndisinda, lã dzãsi a lor: “Elia dealihea prindi s-yinã ma nãinti shi s-adarã itsido. Ma ashã cum easti scriatã trã Hiljilu a-Omlui, elu prindi s-hibã munduit sh-s-dispretsuit. <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Ma mini ma vã-dzãc cã Elia vini sh-cu nãsu featsirã tsi vrurã, ashã cum easti scriatã ti nãsu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ficiorlu Epileptic</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Cãndu s-turnã la ucenitsilji a lui, vidzu unã multsãmi mari anvãrliga di nãshi sh-niscãntsã scribi tsi ma si-ncãcea cu nãshi. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Shi dinãoarã tutã multsãmea, cãndu lu vidzu, s-ciudisi sh-vini trãoarã la nãsu ti salutari. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Sh-elu lã ntribã scriblji: “Trã tse ma vã ncãceats cu nãshi?” <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Sh-un dit multsãmea apãndisinda, lji dzãsi: “Nvitsãtore, ts-adush ficiorlu a meu tsi ari un duh mut, <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />shi u-acatsi iutsido, lu-plãscãneashti sh-elu spumeadzã, cãrtsãneashti dintsilji sh-lji ngljeatsã cicioarili. Lã dzãsh a ucenitsilor a tãlji su-aĝuneascã, ma elji nu puturã s-lu facã.” <verse eid="MRK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Sh-elu dzãsi: “Gheneratã tsi nu-pistipseashti, pãnã-cãndu va hiu cu voi? Pãnã-cãndu va vã aravdã? Adutsets-lu aoa!” <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Sh-elji lu-adusirã. Macãt duhlu lu vidzu, lu-plãscãni cu fuchii cilimeanlu tsi avea cãdzut mpadi, shi s-arucutea spumãnda. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Sh-Isusul lu-ntribã tat-su a lui: “Cãt chiro ari tsi s-fatsi aestã?” Sh-elu dzãsi: “Di cu njic. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Di multi ori lu ari arcatã tu foc sh-tu apã tra s-lu chearã, ma s-pots s-fats tsiva, s-ai njilã trã noi shi nã agiutã!” <verse eid="MRK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Sh-Isusul lji-dzãsi: “Macã tini pots s-pistipsesht, itsido easti putut trã atsel tsi pistipseashti.” <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Dinãoarã tatãl a-ficiorlui, aurlãnda cu lãcri, dzãsi: “Mini pistipsescu, Doamne, agiutã ni-pistipsirea a mea!”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Atumtsea Isusul, vidzãnda cã multsãmea ma yinea trãoarã, lji aurlã al duhlu nicurat, dzãcãnda: “Tini duh tsi mut shi surdu, mini ti ursescu, s-eshi di la nãsu sh-nu intrã pute la nãsu.” <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Sh-demonul, aurlãnda shi trunduinda, ishi di la nãsu. Sh-ficiorlu armasi ca mortu, ashã cãt multsã oaminji dzãtsea: “Ari murit.” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Ma Isusul lu-acãtsã di mãnã, lu-sculã sh-elu shidzu pri cicioari. <verse eid="MRK 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Cãndu Isusul intrã tu casã, ucenitsilji a lui lu ntribarã dinãparti: “Cãtse noi nu putum s-lu aĝunim?” <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Sh-elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Aesti soi di duhuri nu-pots s-li aĝuneshti altã soi, dicãt mash cu rugãciunji.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Aspuni Pridarea a Lui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Dupã tsi s-nchisirã di aclo, tricurã pri Galilea, sh-elu nu vrea si shtibã vãrã. <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />Elu lji nvitsa ucenitsilji a lui sh-lã dzãtsea a lor: “Trãoarã Hiljilu a-Omlui va s-prida tu mãnjili a oaminjlor sh-elji va lu vatãmã, sh-dupã tsi va s-hibã vãtãmatã, elu va s-nyeadzã a-treia dzuã.” <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Ma elji nu achicãsea atseali zboari sh-avea fricã s-lu ntriba Isusul.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ma Marli tu Amirãriljea al Dumnidzãu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Sh-agiumsirã tu Capernaum, sh-cãndu intrã n-casã, lã-ntribã: “Trã tsi vã ntribats namisa di voi pri cali?” <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Ma elji pãpsirã, cã pri cali dzãtsea cu un-alantu, cã cai di elji easti ma marli. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Atumtsea elu shidzu, lã acljimã di doisprãdzatslji sh-lã dzãsi a lor: “Macã vãrã va s-hibã protlu, prindi s-hibã ma nãpoi di tuts shi huzmichearlu a tutulor.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Deapoea lo un cilimean sh-lu bãgã namisa di elji. Deapoea luãnda mbratsã lã dzãsi a lor: <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Caitsido tsi aproachi un dit aeshti cilimenji tu numa a mea, mi aproachi mini, sh-caitsido tsi mi aproachi mini, nu mi aproachi mini, ma atsel tsi mi ari pitricut.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cai Easti cu Isusul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Atumtsea Ioanul lo zborlu sh-dzãsi: “Nvitsãtore, noi vidzum un om tsi nu nã-urmeadzi, tsi li aĝunea demonjlji tu numa a ta, sh-noi lu nchidicãm cã elu nu yinea dupã noi.” <verse eid="MRK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Ma Isusul dzãsi: “Nu lu nchidicats cã nu ari om tsi poati s-facã thavmã tu numa a mea, sh-ma napoi s-greascã arãu trã mini. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Cã cai nu easti contra noi, easti cu noi. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Caitsido tsi va vã da unã cupã cu apã tu numa a mea, cã hits a Hristolui, dealihea ma vã-dzãc cu sigurantsã cã elu nu va u-chearã plãtirea a lui.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cicãrdisirili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Sh-caitsido tsi va s-cicãrdiseascã un di aeshti njitslji tsi pistipsescu la mini, va eara ma ghini ti nãsu s-lji spindzira tu zvercã unã cheatrã mari di moarã shi s-arcã tu amari. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Tora, macã mãna a ta ti cicãrdiseashti trã amãrtii, talji-u, easti ma ghini trã tini s-intsri tu bana eternã cu mãna tsungã, dicãt s-ai doauã mãnji shi s-ti duts tu Colasi, tu foclu tsi nu s-astindzi pute. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />[Aclo iu yermul a lor nu moari sh-foclu nu s-astindzi.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:44,46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aesti doauã stihuri nu s-aflã tu alti manuscrisi.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Macã ciciorlu a tãu ti cicãrdiseashti trã amãrtii, talji-lu, easti ma ghini trã tini s-intsri tu banã shcljiop, dicãt s-ai doau cicioari shi s-ti arucã tu Colasi, tu foclu tsi nu s-astindzi pute. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />[Aclo iu yermul a lor nu moari sh-foclu nu s-astindzi pute.] <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Sh-macã ocljiul a tãu ti adutsi tu amãrtii, scoat-lu. Easti ma ghini trã tini s-intsri tu banã cu un ocljiu, dicãt s-ai doi oclji shi s-ti arucã tu Colasi, <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />[Aclo iu yermul a lor nu moari sh-foclu nu s-astindzi pute]. <verse eid="MRK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Cã caitsido prindi si sãreadzã tu foc sh-itsi curban prindi si sãreadzã cu sari. <verse eid="MRK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Sarea easti bunã, macã sarea cheari njiurizma, cu tsi va u-turnats njiurizma? S-avets sari pri voi shi bãnats tu pace namisa di voi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Dispãrtsãrea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Dupã tsi fudzi di aclo, Isusul s-dusi tu locurili a Iudeiljei ningã Iordan, sh-nãpoi s-adunarã anvãrliga di nãsu multsãmea. Elu nãpoi ahurhi s-lã nveatsã ashã cum eara adetea. <verse eid="MRK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Sh-Fariseilji lu bãgarã tu provã sh-lu ntribarã: “Macã ari volje bãrbatlu, s-lu alasã muljearea?” <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Sh-elu, apãndisinda, lã dzãsi a lor: “Tsi vã ari ordinatã Moisiu?” <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Elji dzãsirã: “Moisiu ari datã volji si-scrii cartea a dispãrtsãriljei shi s-alasã muljearea.” <verse eid="MRK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Sh-Isusul apãndisinda lã-dzãsi a lor: “Trã itia a nchitririljei a ininjilor a voastri elu u scrie aestu ordin. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Ma tu apãrnjita a adãrariljei, <char style="it">Dumnidzãlu adrã mascru sh-theaminã.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" /><char style="it">Trã aestã bãrbatul va alasã tatãl sh-muma sh-va si mpriuneadzã cu muljearea a lui.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" /><char style="it">Ashã doilji va hibã un trup singur.</char> Ashã elji nu suntu ma doi, ma un trup singur. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Trã atsea omlu s-nu dispartã atsea tsi Dumnidzãlu ari mpriunatã!” <verse eid="MRK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Sh-la casã ucenitsilji a lui lu-ntribarã nãpoi trã aestu lucru. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Atumtsea elu lã-dzãsi a lor: “Atsel tsi alasi muljearea a lui shi si nsoari cu unã altã, ncalcã curuna. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Tutashã macã muljearea alasã bãrbatlu shi s-mãriti cu un altu, ncalcã curuna.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isusul shi Cilimenjlji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Atumtsea lji-adusirã niscãntsã cilimenji njitsi tsi elu s-bãga mãna pri nãshi. Ma ucenitsilji lji-vãrghirã atselji tsi lji adusirã. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Cãndu Isusul lu vidzu aestã, si nvirinã sh-lã dzãsi: “Alãsats-lji njitslji cilimenji s-yinã la mini sh-nu lji nchidicats, cã a lor easti amirãriljea al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Dealihea ma vã dzãc cã caitsido tsi nu aproachi amirãriljea al Dumnidzãu ca un cilimean njicã, nu va intrã la nãsã.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Shi cum lji lo mbratsã, lji ghinicuvãntã bãgãnda mãnjili pi nãshi.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tinirlu Avut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Tora cãndu ma s-fãtsea etimu ti cali, ishi nãinti trãoarã un om, s-dzinuclje nãintea a lui, sh-lu-ntribã: “Nvitsãtore bun, tsi prindi s-facã tsi s-mushtinescu bana di totãna?” <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Sh-Isusul lji-dzãsi: “Cãtse nji-dzãts bun? Vãrã nu easti bun, dicãt mash un singur, Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Tini li cunoshti ordinli: <char style="it">‘Nu calcã curuna. Nu vatãmã. Nu fur. Nu fã mãrtirii arãdioasã. Nu arãd. Tinjisea tatãl a tãu shi muma a ta.’</char>” <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Sh-elu apãndisinda, lji-dzãsi: “Nvitsãtore, tuti atseali mini li-am faptã di cu njic.” <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Sh-Isusul lu vidzu cu vreari sh-lji dzãsi: “Un lucru tsã lipseashti: vindã tuti tsi ai shi dã-li a niavutslor shi va s-ai unã ayishteari tu tser. Deapoea haidi, ljea crutsea sh-mi urmeadzã.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Sh-elu si nvirinã trã aesti zboari sh-fudzi amãros cã avea multi aveari.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Sh-Isusul dupã tsi arcã mutrita anvãrliga, lã dzãsi a ucenitsilor a lui: “Cãt greu easti trã atselji tsi au aveari s-intrã tu amirãriljea al Dumnidzãu!” <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Ucenitsilji s-ciudisirã di zboarili a lui. Iarã Isusul grãi nãpoi sh-lã dzãsi a lor: “Hilji, cãt greu easti tsi s-intrã tu amirãriljea al Dumnidzãlu [atselji tsi s-andoapirã la avearea]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aestu stih nu s-aflã tu alti manuscrisi.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Easti ma lishor s-treacã pri guva a-aclui unã cãmilã dicãt s-intrã un avut tu amirãriljea al Dumnidzãu.” <verse eid="MRK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Sh-elji s-ciudisirã sh-ma multu sh-dzãtsea cu un-alantu: “Atumtsea cai poati si-ascapã?” <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Ma Isusul lã vidzu sh-dzãsi: “Aestã trã oaminjlji easti nipututã, ma nu ti Dumnidzãlu. Cã itsido easti pututã ti Dumnidzãlu.” <verse eid="MRK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Atumtsea Petru lo zborlu sh-dzãsi: “Noi alãsãm itsido sh-ti urmãm tini.” <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Isusul apãndisinda, lã-dzãsi: “Dealihea ma vã dzãc cã nu ari vãrã om tsi ari alãsat casa, fratslji, surãrili, tatãl, muma, hiljilji icã agrili trã mini sh-trã evanghelu, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />shi s-nu-ljea tora, tu aestu chiro unã sutã di ori ma multi cãsi, frats, surãri, mumi, hilji sh-agri, deadun cu avinãrili sh-tu eta alantã, tu bana eternã. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Sh-multsã di protslji va s-hibã atselji di ma napoi, shi atselji di ma nãpoi va s-hibã protslji.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hiljilji al Zebedeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Elji eara pri cali cãtrã Ierusalem, sh-Isusul imna nãintea a lor. Sh-elji eara trumuxits sh-lu urma cu fricã. Sh-elu lji adunã di doisprãdzatslji nãpoi dinãparti sh-ahurhi s lã dzãcã tsi va s-lji undzeascã: <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />“Noi ma nidzem cãtrã Ierusalem shi Hiljilu a Omlui va s-prida a arhipreftsãlor sh-a scribilor, sh-elji va lu giudica cu moarti sh-va lu prida tu mãna a pãngãnjilor. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Aeshti va lu pizueascã, va lu scuche, va lu zãpãleascã sh-va lu vatãmã, ma elu a treia dzuã va s-nyeadzã.” <verse eid="MRK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Atumtsea Iacovul sh-Ioanul, hiljilji al Zebedeu s-apruchearã la Isusul sh-lji dzãsirã: “Nvitsãtore, noi vrem tsi tini s-fats trã noi atsea tsi va-s-tsã-cãftãm.” <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Shi elu lã-dzãsi a lor: “Tsi vrets s-fac trã voi?” <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Elji lji-dsãsirã: “Alas-nã tra s-nã apunãm un di nandreapta a ta shi alantu di nastãnga a ta tu mãrirea a ta.” <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Sh-Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Voi nu-shtits tsi cãftats! Putets voi s-bets cupa a munduirilor tsi mini va s-beu shi s-vã pãtidzats cu atsel pãtigiuni tsi mini escu pãtidzat?” <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Elji dzãsirã: “Ie, putem.” Sh-Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Dealihea va s-bets atsea cupã tsi va su beu mini, sh-va-s-vã pãtidzats cu atsea pãtigiuni tsi mini escu pãtidzat, <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />ma nu easti ndreptul a meu tsi s-apunã di nandreapta a mea icã di nastãnga a mea, ma easti trã atselji tsi easti adratã.” <verse eid="MRK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Sh-cãndu li avdzãrã aesti, alantsã dzatsi ahurhirã s-nãrãeascã cãtrã Iacov sh-cãtrã Ioan. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Ma Isus lã acljimã ningã nãsu sh-lã dzãsi: “Voi shtits cã atselji tsi s-acljeamã domnitor a lumiljei lji chivernisescu atselji, sh-mãrlji a lor ufiliseascã pristi nãshi putearea a lor, <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />ma atsea nu prindi s-undzeascã namisa di voi, meti vãrã di voi tsi va s-facã mari, va s-hibã huzmichearlu a vostru. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Sh-caitsido di voi tsi va s-hibã protlu, va s-hibã huzmichearlu a tutulor. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Cã sh-Hiljilu a Omlui nu-vini s-lji huzmitipseascã, ma s-huzmitipseascã shi s-da bana a lui ca tinjii ti arãscumpãrarea a multsãlor.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Orbul al Ierico</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Ashãtsi agiumsirã tu Ierico. Cãndu elu ma isha di Ierico cu ucenitsilji a lui sh-cu unã multsãmi mari, hiljilu al Timaeu, Bartimeul orbu, eara apunat mardzina di cali sh-cãfta. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Cãndu elu avdzã cã atsel tsi ma tritsea eara Isusul Nazareas, apãrnji s-aurlã shi s-dzãcã: “Isuse, Hiljilu al David, njiluia-mi!” <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Multsã lji-aurla s-pãpsea, ma elu aurla sh-ma multã: “Hiljlu al David, njiluia-mi!” <verse eid="MRK 10:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Sh-Isusul dãnãsi sh-ordinã tra s-lu acljeamã. Elji lu acljimarã orbul, dzãcãnda: “Curaiu, scoalã-ti, elu ma ti acljeami!” <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Atumtsea elu lu-arcã nclo mantolu a lui, si-sculã sh-vini la Isus. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Sh-Isusul lji-dzãsi: “Tsi vrei s-tsã fac mini!” Orbul lji-dzãsi: “Rabboni, s-nji-si toarnã videarea!” <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Sh-Isusul lji-dzãsi: “Imnã, pistea a ta ti vindicã!” Sh-trãoarã atsilui lji si-turnã videarea shi s-nchisi pri cali dupã Isusul.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Intrarea al Isus tu Ierusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Tora cãndu s-apruchearã di Ierusalem, cãtrã Betafaghe sh-Betania, ningã Muntili a Masnjilor, Isusul pitricu doi di ucenitsilji a lui, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />dzãcãnda: “Imnats tu hoara di nãintea a-voastrã, sh-macãt s-intrats aclo, va s-aflats un gumãric ligat, tsi vãrã nu lji-ari ncãlicat. Dizligats-lu sh-adutsets-lu la mini. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Sh-macã vãrã vã-dzãtsi: ‘Cãtse ma fãtsets ashã?’, apãndisits-lji: ‘L-hãrzãeashti Domnul. Elu va lu-toarnã trãoarã aoa.’” <verse eid="MRK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Elji s-dusirã shi aflarã gumãriclu ligat aproapi di unã ushã, pri cali sh-u-dizligarã. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Niscãntsã di atselji tsi eara aclo lã dzãsirã a lor: “Tsi fãtsets? Cãtse dizligats gumãriclu?” <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Aeshtsã l-apãndisirã ashã cum lã avea dzãsã Isusul sh-elji lji alãsarã s-fugã. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Atumtsea lji-adusirã al Isus gumãriclu, bãgarã pri supru mantelul a lor sh-elu shidzu pristi nãsu <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Multsã oaminji ashtirna stranjili a lor pri cali sh-alantsãlji tãljea dedzi di ponji sh-li arca pri cali. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Sh-cum atselji tsi njidzea nãinti, sh-atselji tsi yinea dupã Isusul, aurla sh-dzãtsea:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">“<char style="it">Hosana!</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hosana-vrea s-dzãc, Alãvdari a Dumnidzãlui.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">
    <char style="it">Ghinicuvintat easti atsel tsi yini tu numa a Domnului!</char><verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />
    <char style="it">Ghinicuvintat easti amirãriljea al David, tatãl a nostru tsi yini tu numa a Domnului.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">
    <char style="it">Hosana tu locurili multi analti!</char>”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Ashã intrã Isusul tu Ierusalem sh-tu templu. Sh-dupã tsi vidzu ghini itsido, bãgã oarã cã eara amãnat, ishi deadun cu doisprãdzatslji cãtrã Betania.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hiclu Uscat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Alantã dzuã, cãndu ishirã di Betania elu avea foami. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Sh-vidzãnda di diparti un hic tsi avea frãndzi, elu s-dusi di videari nacã putea s-afla tsiva aclo. Ma cãndu s-apruche nu aflã tsiva, dicãt mash frãndzi, cã nu eara chirolu a hitsilor. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Sh-Isusul lji gri a hiclui, dzãcãnda: “Vãrã s-nu mãcã pute frut di la tini.” Sh-ucenitsilji a lui lu-avdzãrã.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cãtãrãsirea a Templui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Ashã agiumsirã tu Ierusalem. Isusul dupã tsi intrã tu templu, apãrnji s-lji aĝuneascã atselji tsi vindea sh-acumpãra nãuntru tu templu sh-li arãsturnã measili a alãxitorilor di pãradzi shi scamnili a vinditorilor di purunghi. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Sh-nu alãsa vãrã tsi s-purta lucri prit templu. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Sh-lã nvitsa, dzãcãnda: “Vahi nu easti scriatã: <char style="it">‘Casa a mea va s-acljeamã casa a rugãciuniljei di tuti natsiunili’</char>? Voi, u-avets adratã ca unã pishtireauã di furii!” <verse eid="MRK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Tora scriblji sh-mãrlji a preftsãlor cãndu li avdzãrã aesti zboari cãfta cã cum s-lu vãtãma, ma avea fricã di nãsu, cã tutã multsãmea eara ciudisit di nvitsãtura a lui. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Cãndu s-featsi searã, Isusul ishi nafoarã di cãsãbã.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pistipsirea Alihioasã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Tu alantã dzuã dimineatsa, tricãnda vidzurã cã hiclu eara uscat dit arãdãtsinã. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Sh-Petrul adusi a-minti shi lj-dzãsi: “Nvitsãtore, ia, hiclu tsi tini blãstimash easti uscat.” <verse eid="MRK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Sh-Isusul apãndisinda lã dzãsi a lor: “Avets pistipsirea al Dumnidzãu! <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Dealihea vã-dzãc, macã vãrã va lji dzãc aishtui munti: ‘Scoalã-ti shi arucã-ti tu amari’, sh-nu va aibã shubei tu inima a lui, ma va s-pistipseascã cã atsea tsi ma dzãtsi va s-facã, itsido va s-lji si-adarã. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Trã atsea ma vã dzãc cã tuti atseali tsi voi cãftats rugãnda, pistipsits cã va li-loats sh-va-vã si da a voauã. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Sh-cãndu ahurhits s-vã rugats, macã avets tsiva contra a vãrui, ljirtats-lu tsi sh-Tatãl a vostru tsi easti tu tseruri, s-vã ljeartã amãrtiili a voastri. <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />[Macã voi nu ljirtats, nitsi Tatãl a vostru tsi easti tu tseruri, nu va-s-vã ljeartã amãrtiili a voastri.]”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Atselu stih nu s-aflã tu alti veaclji manuscrisi.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntribarea a Fariseilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Deapoea elji vinirã nãpoi tu Ierusalem, sh-cãndu elu imna prit templu, mãrlji a preftsãlor, scriblji, sh-aushlji s-apruchearã, <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />sh-lji dzãsirã: “Cu tsi puteari li fats tini aesti lucri? Cai ts-u deadi aestã puteari tsi s-li fats aesti lucri?” <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Sh-Isusul apãndisinda lã dzãsi a lor: “Sh-mini va vã fac un ntribari. Apãndisits-nji sh-mini va vã-dzãc cã cu tsi puteari li fac aesti lucri. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Pãtidzarea a Ioanului eara dit tser ama di la oaminji? Apãndisits-nji.” <verse eid="MRK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Elji ahurhirã s-minduea namisa di nãshi: “Ma s-dzãtsem ‘dit tser’, elu va s-dzãc: ‘Atumtsea cãtse voi nu lji-pistipsitã?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Ma s-lji dzãtsem ‘di la oaminjlji…’” (elji avea fricã di populu, cã tuts dzãtsea cã Ioanlu easti dealihea un prufit). <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Trã atsea apãndisinda, lji dzãsirã al Isus: “Nu shtim.” Sh-Isusul apãndisinda, lã dzãsi a lor: “Nitsi mini nu ma vã-dzãc cã cu tsi puteari li fac aesti lucri.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Arãlji Ayinjeari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Sh-deapoea apãrnji s-lã greascã cu parabolã: “Un om siminã unã ayinji, u anvãrligã cu gardu, adrã un loc di zdruminari aua, adrã un pirĝu trã vigljeari sh-lã-u pistipsi a niscãntsã ayinjeari sh-deapoea s-dusi diparti. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Sh-tu chirolu a cutseariljei pitricu un sclav la ayinjearlji di loari di nãshi unã parti di auã a-ayinjiljei. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Ma elji lu-acãtsarã, lu bãturã sh-lu turnarã cu mãnjili goali. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Elu pitricu nãpoi un altu sclav, ma elji dupã tsi lu-agudirã cu chetri, lu pliguirã la cap sh-lu turnarã arushinat. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Nãpoi pitricu ninga un altu, ma elji lu vãtãmarã. Ma nãpoi pitricu multsã altsã sh-di aeshti multsã lji-bãturã, shi alantsãlji lji-vãtãmarã. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Lj-armasi ninga un di pitritseari: hiljilu a lui vrut. Tu soni lu pitricu sh-atsel dzãcãnda: ‘Ti hiljilu a meu va s-aibã rispect.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Ma ayinjearlji dzãsirã cu un-alantu: ‘Aestu easti mushtinitorlu, s-lu vãtãmãm shi s-nã armãnã a noauã mushtinirea.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Sh-lu acãtsarã, lu-vãtãmarã, sh-lu-arcarã nafoarã di ayinji. <verse eid="MRK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Tsi va s-facã domnul a-ayinjiljei? Elu va yinã sh-va s-lji chearã ayinjearlji shi ayinjea va u-da a alantsãlor. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Ma nu u-avets cãntatã aestã scriturã: ‘Cheatra tsi masturlji u-arcarã, s-featsi cheatra a chioshiljei?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Easti unã cheatrã di nsus tsi u tsãni ngãrcarea a casãljei.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Atsea easti faptã di la Domnul sh-easti unã thavmã tu ocljilji a noastri.’” <verse eid="MRK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Sh-elji cãftarã s-lu acatsã, cã achicãsirã cã elu lã avea dzãsã atsea parabolã contra a lor, ma avea fricã di multsãmea, sh-lu-alãsarã sh-fudzirã.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Plãtirea a Tãxilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Dupã atsea lji-pitricurã niscãntsã Farisei sh-Ierodianji tsi s-lu acãtsa tu zboari. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Aeshti vinirã sh-lji dzãsirã: “Nvitsãtore, noi shtim cã tini eshti dealihea sh-nu ntreghi di vãrã, cã nu badzã oarã fãnirusirea a-oaminjlor, ma lã nvets calea a Dumnidzãlui dupã ndriptatea. Easti ndreptu s-plãteshti taxa a Cezarlui ama nu? Prindi s-u plãtim ama nu?” <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Ma elu, cunuscãnda ipucrizia-a lor, lã-dzãsi: “Cãtse mi bãgats tu provã? Adutsets-nji un denar tra s-lu ved!” <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Elji lji-adusirã. Shi elu lã dzãsi a lor: “A cui easti aestã fatsã sh-inscriptsea aestã?” Elji lji-dzãsirã: “A Cesarului.” <verse eid="MRK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Atumtsea Isusul apãndisi sh-lã dzãsi a lor: “Dats-lji a Cesarului atsea tsi easti a Cesarului, sh-a Dumnidzãlui atsea tsi easti a Dumnidzãlui.” Sh-elji s-ciudisirã cu nãsu.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sadutseilji sh-Nyearea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Deapoea vinirã niscãntsã Sadutsei tsi dzãc cã nu ari nyeari, sh-lu ntribarã dzãcãnda: <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Nvitsãtore, Moisiul nã-alãsã scris tsi cãndu moari fratili a vãrui sh-alasi muljearea ni-fãrã cilimenji, fratili a lui prindi si-nsoarã cu veduva tra s-lji facã dupãyinitori a fratilui. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Tora eara shapti frats, protlu si-nsurã sh-muri sh-nu alãsã cilimenji. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />U lo a doilu, ma sh-elu muri sh-nu alãsã cilimenji, tutashã sh-a treilu. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Di shaptilji u loarã di muljeari sh-murirã, sh-nu alãsarã mushtinitori (dupãyinitori). Sh-dupã tuts muri sh-muljearea. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />La nyeari, cãndu va-s nyeadzã, muljearea a cui di nãshi va hibã ea? Cã di shapti u-avurã muljeari.” <verse eid="MRK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Isusul apãndisinda lã dzãsi a lor: “Trã atsea voi hits tu cãbati cã nu-shtits nitsi scriturili nitsi putearea a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Cãndu oaminjlji va s-nyeadzã dit mortsã, nitsi va si-nsoarã, nitsi va si s-mãritã, ma va hibã ca anghilji dit tser. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Cãt di nyearea a mortsãlor, nu avets cãntat tu cartea a Moisiului cã cum grãi Dumnidzãlu dit rudz dzãcãnda: ‘Mini escu Dumnidzãlu al Abraham, Dumnidzãlu al Isac, sh-Dumnidzãlu al Iacov.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Elu nu easti Dumnidzãlu a mortsãlor, ma Dumnidzãlu a yiilor. Ashã cã voi hits tu cãbati.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ursirea Atsea Marea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Sh-un di scriblji tsi avea avdzãtã zburarea a lor, achicãsinda cã elu lã avea apãndisitã ghini, s-apruche sh-lu-ntribã: “Cai easti protlu ordin di tuti?” <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Sh-Isusul apãndisi: “Protlu ordin a tutulor easti: ‘Ascultã Israel! Domnul, Dumnidzãlu a nostru easti singur Domnu.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Shi ‘S-vrei Domnul, Dumnidzãlu a tãu, cu tutã inima a ta, cu tutã suflitlu a tãu, cu tutã mintea a ta, sh-cu tutã putearea a ta!’ Aestã easti protlu ordin. <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Shi a doilu lji-undzeashti aishtui: ‘S-vrei aproapilu a tãu ca cum ti vrei tini.’ Nu ari altu ordin ma mari di aestu.” <verse eid="MRK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Shi scriblu lji dzãsi: “Ghini, nvitsãtore. Ai dzãsã dupã alihea, cã ari singur un Dumnidzã sh-nu ari vãrã altu dicãt elu. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Shi s-vrei cu tutã inima, cu tutã mintea, cu tutã suflitlu sh-cu tutã putearea, shi s-lu vrei aproapilu ca cum ti vrei tini, ma multu di cãt scrumbatslji sh-curbãnjlji.” <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Isusul vidzãnda cã atsel eara apãndisitã cu minti, lji dzãsi: “Tini nu eshti diparti di amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui.” Sh-vãrã altã nu cutidza s-lu ntriba.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hristolu, Hiljilu al David</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Sh-Isusul nvitsãnda tu templu, dzãsi: “Cum pot s-dzãc scriblji cã Hristolu easti Hiljilu al David? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Cã mash Davidul, prit Suflitlu Sãmtu dzãsi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="it">‘Domnul lji-dzãsi a Domnului a meu:</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="it">“Shedz tu nandreapta a mea,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="it">pãn-cãndu s-lji facã neamitsilji a tãlji scamnu</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="it">di cicioarili a tali.”’</char><verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Idyiul David lu acljeami Domnu, cum poati elu s-hibã hiljilu a lui?” Sh-multsãmea lu avdza cu harauã.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ipucrizia a Scribilor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Sh-elu lã dzãtsea a lor tu nvitsãtura a lui: “Afirits-vã di scriblji, tsi arsescu s-imnã cu stranji lundzi shi s-lji saluteadzã prit pãdzi, <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />shi s-aibã protili locuri tu sinagogã sh-protili locuri prit uspetsi. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Elji mãcã cãsili a veduvilor shi tra si s-veadã, s-roagã multu. Elji va ljea unã giudicatã ma greauã.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oferta a Veduvãljei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Isusul s-apunã nãinti di cutia a ayishteariljei sh-mutrea oaminjlji tsi bãga nãuntru denar, avutslji bãga nãuntru ma multu. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Vini unã veduvã niavutã sh-bãgã doi pãradz njitsi, tsi fac un cuadrant.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Easti pãradz njicu dip, unã munedã.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Sh-Isusul lji-acljimã ucenitsilji a lui ningã nãsu sh-lã dzãsi: “Vã dzãc dealihea cã aestã veduvã niavutã ari bãgat tu cutii ma multu di tuts alantsãlji. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Cã tuts bãgarã nãuntru dit artirizma a lor, ma ea cu ni-avearea a ljei bãgã tutã tsi avea ti bãnari.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Prufitsia di Templu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Cãndu elu ma ishea dit templu, un di ucenitsilji a lui lj-dzãsi: “Nvitsãtore, vedz tsi chetri shi tsi adãrãturi!” <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Sh-Isusul apãndisinda lj-dzãsi: “Li vedz aesti adãrãturi mãri? Nu va s-armãnã cheatrã pisti cheatrã ni dãrãmat.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahurhirea a Durerilor trã Amintari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Sh-dupã tsi elu eara apunat pri Muntili a Masnjilor nãintea a templui, Petrul, Iacovul, Ioanul shi Andrea lu ntribarã dinãparti: <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Dzã-nã, cãndu va s-facã aesti lucri sh-cai va s-hibã semnul a chirolu tsi tuti atseali lucri va si s-facã?” <verse eid="MRK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Isusul apãndisinda a lor ahurhi s-dzãcã: “Bãgats mintea s-nu vã-arãdã vãrã. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Cã va yinã multsã pi numa a mea dzãcãnda: ‘Mini escu Hristolu.’ Sh-va si s-arãdã multsã oaminji. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Ma cãndu s-avdzãts si zburãscu di alumti sh-di hãbãri di alumti, nu vã tulburats, cã aesti lucri prindi si s-adarã, ma nu va s-hibã bitisita. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Va sã scoalã natsiunea contra a natsiuniljei, amirãriljea contra a amirãriljei, va s-facã tulburari pri multi locuri, va s-aibã foami di pãni sh-mintituri. Atseli lucri va s-hibã ahurhirea a durerilor di amintari. <verse eid="MRK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Cãshtigats-vã ti bana a voastrã! Cã va vã prida la giudicãtorlji sh-va vã batã tu sinagogã. Va vã scoatã nãintea a guvernatorilor shi a amiradzlor trã itia a mea tsi s-mãrtirsits nãintea a lor. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Ma, ma nãinti prindi tsi s-hibã predicatã evanghelu la tuts oaminjlji. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Cãndu va vã ducã s-vã prida, s-nu avets gaile di ma nãinti trã atsea tsi prindi s-dzãtsets shi s-nu minduits tsiva. Dzãtsets tsi vã yini tu minti tu oara atsea, cã nu hits voi tsi grits ma easti Duhlu Sãmtu. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Fratili va prida fratilu a lui la moarti shi tatãl hiljilu, sh-hiljilji va sã scoalã contra a pãrintsãlor sh-va lji ducã tu moarti. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Voi va s-hits aurats di tuts trã itia a numãljei a mea, ma atsel tsi va s-aravdã pãnã tu soni, va s-hibã ascãpat.”<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Munduirea Atsea Marea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />“Sh-cãndu s-u videts urãciunea a-aspãrdzeariljei [tsi easti aspusã di prufitul Daniel], tsi sta aclo iu nu prindi s-eara [cai ghivãseashti s-aducheascã], atumtsea atselji tsi va s-hibã tu Iudea, s-fugã pri muntsã. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Atsel tsi easti pri citia a casãljei, s-nu dipunã, sh-nitsi s-intrã tu casã di loari tsiva di la casa-a lui. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Atsel tsi va s-hibã tu cãmpu, nu s-toarnã nãpoi di loari stranjilu a lui. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Tora cavai di muljerili sãrtsinati sh-atseali cu njitsi tu sinã, tu atseali dzãli. <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Rugats-vã tsi fudzirea a voastrã s-nu hibã iarna. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Cã tu atsea dzuã va s-hibã unã munduiri mari, ma mari dit apãrnjita a adrariljei a Omlui tsi featsi Dumnidzãlu pãnã azã, sh-ahtari nu va s-aibã pute. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Macã Domnul nu va li-avea shcurtatã atseli dzãli, vãrã om nu va ascãpa, ma Domnul li shcurtã atseali dzãli trã itia a aleptsilor tsi elu lã aleapsi. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Atumtsea macã vãrã va vã-dzãcã: ‘Ia, Hristolu easti aoa’, icã: ‘Easti aclo’, nu lu pistipsits. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Cã va s-easã hristoshi arãdioshi sh-prufits arãdioshi tsi va s-facã seamni shi thavmati tsi s-arãdã, ma s-poatã sh-aleptsilji. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Ma voi bãgats minti! Ia, mini vã hãbãrsii ti itsido.”<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Turnarea a Hiljilui a Omlui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />“Tu atseali dzãli, dupã munduirea atsea, soarili va si scutidiseascã sh-luna nu va s-da lunjina a ljei. <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Stealili a tserlui va s-cadã sh-puterili di tu tseruri va s-trundueascã. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Atumtsea va lu veadã Hiljilu a Omlui yininda pri niori, cu puteari mari sh-mãriri. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Atumtsea elu va pitreacã anghilji a lui sh-va lji-adunã aleptsilji a lui dit patruli vimturi, dit mardzina a loclui pãnã tu mardzina a tserlui.”<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Parabola a Hiclui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />“Tora nvitsats nvitsãtura a hiclui: cãndu dedzili a lui s-muljeadzã shi scoatã frãndzi, voi shtits cã veara easti aproapi. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Ashã sh-voi, cãndu va videts cã ma s-facã aesti lucri, si shtits cã Hiljilu a Omlui easti aproapi, ningã ushã. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Dealihea ma vã dzãc: cã aestã gheneratã nu va s-treacã, pãnã cãndu tuti aesti va s-hibã adrati. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Tserlu sh-loclu va s-treacã, ma zboarili a meali nu va s-treacã.”<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bãgats Oarã ti Chirolu di Soni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />“Cãt di atsea dzuã sh-di atsea oarã, vãrã nu shtii, nitsi anghilji dit tser, nitsi Hiljilu, ma mash Tatãl. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Bãgats minti, s-hits dishtiptats shi rugats-vã, cã nu shtits cãndu va s-hibã oara. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Easti ca un om tsi nchisinda ti cali, alasi casa a lui shi da autoritati a huzmichearilor a lui, cathiun tu loclu a lui, sh-portarlu lu urseashti s-hibã dishtiptat. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Trã atsea stats dishtiptat, cã nu shtits cãndu va s-yinã domnul ali casi, seara ma njeadzã-noapti, cãndu cãnti cucotlu, ama dimineatsa, <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />tsi turnãnda niashtiptat, s-nu vã aflã tu somnu. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Tora, aestã tsi vã dzãc a voauã, lã-u dzãc a tutulor: S-hits dishtiptat!”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Apofãsirea a Preftsãlor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Dupã doauã dzãli eara Pashtili sh-Adzãmili, sh-ma mãrlji a preftsãlor shi scriblji cãfta cum s-acãtsa Isusul cu ilei, shi s-lu vãtãma. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Ma dzãtsea: “Nu tu chirolu a sãrbãtoariljei, tsi s-nu aibã mintiturã tu popul.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul tu Betania</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Isusul eara tu Betania, tu casa al Simon tsi eara lepros, sh-cãndu eara la measã intrã unã muljeari cu un vas di alabastru cu untulem njiurizmat cu nardu curat, multu scumpu sh-ea lu-frãmsi vaslu di alabastru sh-lji lu-virsã untulemlu pri cap. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Niscãntsã s-nãrãirã sh-dzãsirã: “Cãtse tutã aestã hãrgiuiri a untulemlui?” <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Cã aestu untulem putea s-vindea ma multu di trei suti di denari shi aesti si s-da a niavutslor. Sh-eara nevrisits cu nãsu. <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Ma Isusul dzãsi: “Alãsats-u! Cãtse u munduits? Ea featsi un lucru bunã trã mini. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Cã niavutslji va lji avets totãna cu voi, sh-cãndu s-vrets, putets s-lã fãtsets ghini. Ma mini nu va mi-avets totãna. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Ea featsi atsea tsi putu, aumsi di ma nãinti truplu a meu trã ngrupari. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Dealihea ma vã dzãcã cã tu tutã dunjeaua iutsido tsi va hibã predicat aestu evanghelu, va s-aspunã sh-aestã tsi ea featsi, ti adutseari aminti ea.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pãhãlu a Pridariljei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Atumtsea Iuda Iscariotul, un di doisprãdzatslji, s-dusi la mãrlji a preftsãlor tra s-vindã Isusul. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Sh-elji cãndu avdzãrã, s-hãrsirã sh-lji tãxirã cã va lji da pãradzi. Ashã elu cãfta oara tsi prindi trã dari.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Etimãsirea a Pashtiljei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Tu prota dzuã a Adzãmilor, cãndu s-featsi curbanlu a Pashtiljei ucenitsilji a lui dzãsirã: “Iu vrei s-nidzem s-adrãm di mãcari Pashtili?” <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Sh-elu pitricu doi di ucenitsilji a lui dzãcãnda: “Imnats tu cãsãbã sh-aclo va s-adunats un om tsi tsãni un stamnã cu apã, urmats-lu. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Sh-aclo iu elu va s-intrã, dzãtsets-lji a domnului ali casi: ‘Nvitsãtorlu ntreabi: Iu easti udãlu tsi putem s-mãcãm Pashtili cu ucenitsilji a melji?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Sh-elu va vã aspunã nsus unã udã mari uidisitã sh-etimã. Aclo etimãsits trã noi.” <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Ucenitsilji a lui s-dusirã, agiumsirã tu cãsãbã aflarã ashã cum dzãsi elu, sh-etimãsirã Pashtili.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsina a Pashtiljei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Cãndu s-featsi searã, Isusul vini cu doisprãdzatslji. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Cãndu ma shidea la measã sh-ma mãca, Isusul dzãsi: “Dealihea vã dzãcã cã un di voi tsi ma mãcã cu mini, va mi vindã.” <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Atumtsea elji ahurhirã sã nvirineadzã sh-dzãtsea cu un-alantu: “Nacã escu mini?” [Shi un altã dzãsi: “Nacã escu mini?”]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tu alti manuscrisi aestã nu s-aflã.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Sh-elu, apãndisinda lã dzãsi a lor: “Easti un di doisprãdzatslji tsi moalji cu mini tu cãtsãn. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Hiljilu a Omlui ma s-dutsi cum easti scriatã trã nãsu, ma cavai di atsel om cai vindi Hiljilu a Omlui. Va eara ma ghini trã nãsu, tsi atsel om s-nu eara amintat pute!”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pisti-ligãtura atsea Noaua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Sh-cãndu elji ma mãca, Isusul lo pãnea, u ghinicuvãntã, u mpãrtsã, sh-u deadi a lor dzãcãnda: “Loats sh-mãcats. Aestu easti truplu a meu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Deapoea lo cupa, lu hãristisi, u deadi a lor sh-tuts biurã di nãsã. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Atumtsea lã dzãsi: “Aestu easti sãndzili a meu, a pisti-ligãturiljei, tsi s-vearsi trã multsã. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Dealihea vã dzãcã cã nu va beau ma dit carpolu a ayinjiljei pãnã tu atsea dzuã cãndu va s-u beau dinou tu amirãriljea al Dumnidzãu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Sh-dupã tsi cãntarã un himnu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eara unã adeti a Iudeilor tsi s-cãnta un psalm tu vahtea a Pashtiljei. Nãinti di mãcari elji cãnta Ps 113-114 shi Ps 115-118 dupã vahti di mãcari. </char></note>, ishirã shi s-dusirã cãtrã Muntili a Masnjilor.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul sh-Petrul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Isusul lã dzãsi a lor: “Voi tuts va vã cicãrdisits cu mini aestã searã, cã easti scriatã:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">
    <char style="it">‘Va lu agudescã picurarlu</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 14:27">
    <char style="it">sh-oili va s-arãspãndeascã.’</char><verse eid="MRK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Ma dupã tsi va mi-nyedz, mini va mi duc nãinti di voi tu Galilea.” <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Sh-Petrul lji-dzãsi: “Ca s-hibã cã tuts alantsãlji s-cicãrdiseascã cu tini, mini nu va mi cicãrdisescu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Sh-Isusul lji-dzãsi: “Mini ma ts-dzãc dealihea cã azã, tu aestã noapti, nãinti tsi cucotlu s-cãntã doauã ori, tini va mi alepidz trei ori.” <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Ma elu ipiminisãnda, dzãtsea: “Sh-ca s-hibã cã prindi s-mor cu tini, nu va ti aleapid pute.” Unã soi dzãsirã sh-tuts alantsãlji.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul tu Ghetsemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Deapoea agiumsirã la un loc tsi s-acljima Ghetsemani, sh-elu lã dzãsi a ucenitsilor a lui: “Apunats-vã aoa, pãnã-cãndu mini s-mi rog.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Sh-lo cu nãsu Petrul, Iacovul sh-Ioanul, sh-ahurhi s-aibã fricã sh-agonii. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Sh-lã dzãsi a lor: “Suflitlu a meu easti multu nvirinat, pãnã tu moarti, armãnets aoa shi s-hits dishtiptat.” <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Sh-cum s-dusi niheamã nãinti, cãdzu pri dintsi shi s-ruga, tsi ma s-eara putut, s-treacã di la nãsu atsea oarã. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Sh-dzãsi: “Abba, Tate, itsido trã tini easti putut, dipãrteadz-u di la mini aestã cupã. Ma nu atsea tsi voi mini, ma atsea tsi vrei tini!” <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Apoia s-turnã nãpoi, sh-lji aflã durnjinda sh-lji dzãsi a Petrului: “Simon ma dornji? Nu putush s-stai dishtiptat nitsi unã oarã? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Armãnets dishtiptat sh-rugats-vã tra s-nu intrats tu cãrteari. Duhlu easti etimu, ma truplu easti niputut.” <verse eid="MRK 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />S-dipãrtã nãpoi shi s-ruga dzãcãnda idyili zboari. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Cãndu s-turnã, lji aflã nãpoi tu somnu, cã ocljilji a lor lã-ngrica sh-elji nu shtia tsi s-apãndisea. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />S-turnã di a treia oarã sh-lã dzãtsi a lor: “Ninga ma durnjits sh-vã discurmats. Agiundzi, vini oara! Ia, Hiljilu a Omlui ma s-prida tu mãnjili a amãrtioshilor. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Sculats-vã, s-ni dutsem. Ia, atsel tsi ma mi prida easti aproapi!”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Acãtsarea al Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Sh-tu atsea oarã, cãndu elu ninga ma grea, vini Iuda, un di doisprãdzatslji, sh-cu nãsu unã multsãmi mari cu spãtsi sh-cu ciumãdzi, pitricut di mãrlji a preftsãlor, di scriblji sh-di aushlji. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Sh-elu tsi ma lu pridea lji avea datã a-lor un semnu: “Atsel cai va s-bash, elu easti. Acãtsats-lu shi adutsets-lu cu mari cãshtigã.” <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Sh-cum agiumsi s-apruche trãoarã la nãsu sh-lji dzãsi: “Rabbi, Rabbi!” Sh-lu bãshe. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Atumtsea elji bãgarã mãna pri nãsu sh-lu-acãtsarã. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Un di atselji tsi s-afla aclo, scoasi spata, agudi sclavlu a arhipreftlui sh-lji tãlje ureaclja. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Sh-Isusul apãndisinda, lã dzãsi: “Avets vinit cu spãts sh-cu ciumãdzi tra s-mi acãtsats? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Cathi dzuã earam namisa di voi tu templu nvitsãnda sh-voi nu mi acãtsat. Ma aestã s-fatsi tra si mplineascã Scriturili.” <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Atumtsea ucenitsilji lu alãsarã sh-fudzirã tuts. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Sh-un tinir, tsi era anvãrtit cu un pãndzã tu truplu dispuljeat ma lu urma, sh-elji lu acãtsarã. <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />Elu u alãsã pãndza sh-fudzi dispuljeat.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Nãintea al Sinedriu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Atumtsea elji lu dusirã Isusul la arhipreftul iu s-adunarã mãrlji a preftsãlor, aushlji shi scriblji. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Petrul lu urmã di diparti pãnã nãuntru tu pãlatlu a arhipreftlui shi s-apunã aclo deadun cu vigljitorlji shi s-ncãldza ningã foc. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Sh-mãrlji a preftsãlor sh-tutã sinedriul cãfta mãrtirii contra al Isus s-lu vãtãma, ma nu ma afla. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Multsã oaminji fãtsea mãrtirii arãdioasã contra a lui, ma mãrtiriili a lor nu s-uidisea. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Atumtsea niscãntsã si scularã sh-mãrtirsirã cu ilei contra a lui dzãcãnda: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Noi avem avdzãtã cã tsi ari dzãsã: ‘Mini va lu aspargã aestu templu adratã cu mãnji, sh-di trei dzãli va s-adarã un altu tsi nu va hibã faptã di oaminjlji.’” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Ma nitsi cu aestã mãrtiria a lor nu s-uidisea. <verse eid="MRK 14:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Atumtsea si sculã arhipreftul namisa di cuvendã sh-lu ntribã Isusul dzãcãnda: “Nu apãndiseshti dip? Tsi ma mãrtirsescu aeshti contra di tini?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Ma elu pãpsi sh-nu apãndisi dip. Arhipreftul nãpoi lu ntribã sh-lji dzãsi: “Tini eshti Hristolu, Hiljilu a Ghinicuvintatlui?” <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Sh-Isusul dzãsi: “Mini escu. <char style="it">Sh-voi va lu videts Hiljilu a Omlui apunat tu nandreapta a Puteariljei shi yininda cu norilji a tserlui.</char>” <verse eid="MRK 14:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Atumtsea arhipreftul, arupãnda stranjili dzãsi: “Tsi ananghi avem ti amãrtioshlji? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Voi lu avdzãt blãstemlu, cum lu videts?” Sh-tuts lu giudicarã cu moarti. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Sh-niscãntsã ahurhirã s-lu scuchea, s-lji anvãlea fatsa, shi s-lu agudea cu shupleacã shi s-lji dzãtsea: “Prufitipsea!” Sh-vigljitorlji lu agudea.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petrul Arniseashti Isusul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Cãndu Petrul eara nghios tu ubor, vini un di huzmichearili a arhipreftlui. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Sh-cãndu vidzu Petrul tsi ma s-ncãldza, lu vidzu cu cãshtiga sh-lji dzãsi: “Sh-tini earai cu Isus Nazareas.” <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Petrul alipidãnda dzãsi: “Nu lu cunoscu, sh-nu achicãsescu tsi dzãtsi.” Deapoea ishi nafoarã tu intrata a uborlui sh-cucotlu cãntã. <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Sh-huzmichearea vidzãnda nãpoi ahurhi s-lã greascã atsilor tsi eara aclo: “Aestu easti di nãshi.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Ma elu nãpoi u-ari alipidat. Sh-niheamã ma nãpoi oaminjlji lji dzãsirã nãpoi a Petrului: “Dealihea tini eshti un di atselji, cã tini eshti Galilean sh-grearea a ta s-cunoashti.” <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Ma elu ahurhi s-blastimã shi si spigiurã: “Mini nu lu cunoscu atsel om ti cai ma grits.” <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Sh-cucotlu cãntã di a doaua oarã. Atumtsea a Petrului lj-vini tu minti zborlu tsi Isusul lji avea dzãsã: “Ma nãinti tsi cucotlu s-cãntã di doauã ori, tini va mi aleapidz trei ori.” Sh-cum mindui aestã, plãmsi.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Isusul Nãintea al Pilat, Guvernatorlu Romac</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Curund dimineatsa mãrlji a preftsãlor cu aushlji, scriblji sh-tut Sinedriul featsirã consiliu, ligarã Isusul, lu dusirã nafoarã sh-lu-prideadirã al Pilat. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Sh-Pilatul lu ntribã: “Tini eshti amirãlu a Iudeilor?” Sh-elu apãndisinda lji dzãsi: “Tini dzãts!” <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Mãrlji a preftsãlor lu acuza di multi lucri, ma elu nu apãndisea dip. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Pilatul lu ntribã nãpoi dzãcãnda: “Nu apãndiseshti dip? Vedz ti cãti lucri ti acuzeascã!” <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Ma Isusul nu apãndisi dip, sh-Pilatul armasi ciudisit. <verse eid="MRK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Tu cathi sãrbãtoari eara ca adeti tsi si sãlãghea a lor un hãpsãnit, caitsido tsi populu cãfta. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Sh-eara tu hapsi un om acljimatã Baraba, deadun cu sotslji a lui rebilji, tsi avea faptã un vãtãmari la un rebilipsiri. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Sh-multsãmea, aurlãnda, ahurhi tra s-caftã s-facã ashã cum avea faptã totãna cu nãshi. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Iarã Pilatul lã apãndisi a lor dzãcãnda: “Vrets s-vã sãlãghescu amirãlu a Iudeilor?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Cã lu shtia tsi mãrlji a preftsãlor lu avea pridatã di inati. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Ma mãrlji a preftsãlor lji deadirã curaiu a multsãmiljei s-cãfta sãlãghirea al Baraba. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Sh-Pilatul lo zborlu nãpoi sh-lã dzãsi a lor: “Tsi vrets s-fac cu atsel tsi voi lu acljimats amirãlu a Iudeilor?” <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Elji aurlarã nãpoi: “Crutsisits-lu!” <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Sh-Pilatul lã dzãsi a lor: “Ma tsi arãu ari faptã?” Atumtsea elji aurlarã sh-ma multu: “Crutsisits-lu?” <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Trã atsea Pilatul vrãnda s-lji arsea a multsãmiljei, lã l-sãlãghi Baraba. Sh-dupã tsi lu zãpãlirã Isusul, lu deadi a lor tsi s-lu crutsisea.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pizuirea Nãintea a Crutsisiriljei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Sh-suldatslji lu-dusirã Isusul tu uborlu di nãuntru, tu pretorium sh-adunarã tutã cohorta. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Lu-nviscurã cu mitashi, lji mplãtirã unã curuni di schinji sh-lji-u bãgarã pri cap <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Deapoea apãrnjirã s-lu saluteascã, dzãcãnda: “Sãnãtati amirãlu a Iudeilor!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Sh-lu agudea pristi cap cu un cãlam, lu scuchea sh-dzinucljãnda nãintea a lui, lu alãvda. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Dupã tsi arãsirã cu nãsu, disviscurã mitasha, lu nviscurã cu stranjili a lui, sh-lu scoasirã afoarã s-lu crutsisea.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Crutsisirea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Elji ursirã un cãlãtor, Simonul di Tsirenea tsi s-turna dit agru, tatãl al Alexandru sh-al Rufi, tsi s-tsãnea crutsea a lui. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Deapoea lu dusirã Isusul tu loclu acljimatã Golgota, tsi va s-dzãcã “Loclu a Cafcãljei.” <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Lji deadirã s-bea yin misticat cu njirã, ma elu nu u lo. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Sh-dupã tsi lu crutsisirã, lji mpãrtsãrã stranjili a lui sh-arcarã soarti tra s-shtia tsi va avea cathiunu. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Eara oara a treia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ora a treia va s-dzãc ora noauã dimineatsa</char></note> cãndu lu crutsisirã. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Scritura tsi aspunea sibepea a acuzãljei tsi eara bãgatã pristi nãsu dzãtsea: “Amirãlu a Iudeilor.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Deadun cu nãsu crutsisirã sh-doi furii, un tu nandreapta a lui sh-alantu tu nastãnga a lui. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />[Ashã si mplini Scritura tsi dzãtsi: “Elu s-lugursi cu urutsilji.”]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dit Isaia 53:12</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Sh-atselji tsi tritsea atsia aproapi lu ngiura sh-giucãnda caplu, dzãtsea: “Tini tsi aspãrdzeai templu sh-lu adrai di trei dzãli, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />ascapã-ti sh-dipunã di crutsi.” <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Tutashã sh-mãrlji a preftsãlor shi scriblji arãdãnda dzãtsea cu un-alantu: “Alantsãlji lji ascãpã, ma elu nu poati s-ascapã. <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Hristolu, amirãlu a Israelui, s-dipunã tora di crutsi tra s-lu videm shi s-lu pistipsim.” Sh-atselji tsi eara crutsisits deadun cu nãsu, lu ngiura.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moartea al Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Deapoea cãndu vini a shasea oarã, ntuneariclu anvãli tut loclu pãnã la a noaua oarã. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Sh-la a noaua oara Isusul aurlã cu boatsi analtã: “<char style="it">Eloi, Eloi lama sabacthani?</char>”, tsi va s-dzãcã: “<char style="it">Dumnidzãlu a meu, Dumnidzãlu a meu cãtse mi ai alãsat?</char>” <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Sh-niscãntsã di atselji di aproapi, cãndu avdzãrã, dzãsirã: “Ia, elu ma lji greashti al Elia!” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Atumtsea un di nãshi vini trãoarã mulje un sfungu tu puscã, sh-dupã tsi l-bãgã tu un cãlami lji-lu deadi s-bea, dzãcãnda: “Alãsats-lu, s-videm macã va yinã Elia s-lu dipun nghios.” <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Ma Isusul cum featsi unã mari aurlari, deadi suflitlu. <verse eid="MRK 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Sh-velul<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Velul easti unã pãndzã tsi dispãrtsa doauã udãdzili</char></note> tu templu s-disicã pri doauã di nsus pãnã nghios. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Tsenturionul tsi stãtea nãintea al Isus, cãndu vidzu cã Isusul aurlã ashã, sh-deadi suflitlu, dzãsi: “Dealihea aestu om eara Hiljilu a Dumnidzãlui!” <verse eid="MRK 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Atsia eara tutashã sh-muljerili tsi videa di diparti. Namisa di nãsi eara Maria Magdalena sh-Maria muma al Iacovu atsel njiclu sh-al Iose, sh-Salomea, <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />cai lu avea urmat sh-lji avea huzmitipsitã di cãndu eara tu Galilea, eara sh-multi alti tsi avea vinit deadun cu elu tu Ierusalem.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngruparea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Tora s-apruche seara, sh-eara Etimãsirea, tsi va s-dzãcã apirirea a Sãmbãtãljei, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Iosifu dit Arimatea, un consilier rispectat, cai ashtipta amirãriljea a Dumnidzãlui, cu curaiu intrã la Pilatu shi cãftã truplu al Isus. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Sh-Pilatul s-ciudisi cã tora elu avea murit. Acljimã tsenturionlu sh-lu ntribã macã avea murit di multu chiro. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Shi cum si siguripsi di tsenturionlu, lu alãsã truplu al Iosif. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Aestu, dupã tsi acumpãrã unã pãndzã, lu dipunã Isusul di crutsi, lu anvãrti cu pãndzã sh-lu bãgã tu un murmintu tsi eara disfapt tu cheatrã, deapoea arucuti unã cheatrã dininti di usha a murmintului. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Sh-Maria Magdalena sh-Maria, muma al Iose mutrea iu lu bãgarã.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Nyearea al Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Cum tricu Sãmbãta, Maria Magdalena sh-Maria, muma al Iacov, sh-Salomea, acumpãrarã njurizmati s-njidzea s-aundzea Isusul. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Dimineatsa tu prota dzuã a stãmãnãljei, tahina dimineatsa, eali vinirã la murmintu cãndu ma isha soarili. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Sh-dzãtsea namisa di nãsi: “Cai va nã-u arucuteascã cheatra di la intrata a murmintului?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Ma cãndu scularã ocljilji, vidzurã cã cheatra eara arucutitã cu tutã cã eara multu mari. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Intrarã la murmintu sh-vidzurã un tinir tsi eara apunat di nandreapta, nviscut cu albi, sh-armasirã aspãrati. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Ma elu lã dzãsi a lor: “Nu vã aspãrats! Voi cãftats Isus Nazareanlu tsi eara crutsisit, elu s-nyie, nu easti aoa. Ia, loclu iu eara bãgatã. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Tora imnats s-lã-dzãtsets a ucenitsilor a lui sh-a Petrului cã elu ma s-dutsi dininti di voi tu Galilea, aclo va lu videts ashã cum vã dzãsi.” <verse eid="MRK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Sh-eali ishirã trãoarã sh-fudzirã dit murmintu cã li acãtsã cutremburlu sh-ciudia, sh-nu lji-dzãsirã tsiva a vãrui cã avea fricã.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Nyeat Vidzut di Niscãntsã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />[Tora Isusul dupã tsi eara nyeat dimineatsa tu prota dzuã a stãmãnãljei, s-fãnirusi prota ali Marii Magdalena, di la cai avea aĝunit shapti demonji. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Ea s-dusi sh-aspusi a lor tsi eara deadun cu nãsã tsi vãita sh-plãndzea. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Ma aeshti cãndu avdzãrã cã eara yiu shi s-vidzu di ea nu lu pistipsirã. <verse eid="MRK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Dupã aesti lucri, s-fãnirusi tu unã altã formã a doilor di nãshi, tsi ma njidzea tu hoarã. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Sh-elji s-dusirã sh-aspusirã la alantsã, ma nitsi aeshti nu lu pistipsirã.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isusul Nyeat cu Ucenitsilji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Tu soni s-fãnirusi a unsprãdzatsilor cãndu eara la measã sh-lji vãrghi trã nipistipsirea a lor sh-trã nchitrirea a inimãljei, cã nu avea pistipsitã la nãshi cã lu avea vidzutã nyeat. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Deapoea lã dzãsi a lor: “Njidzets la tutã lumea sh-predicats evanghelu a tutulor. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Atsel tsi pistipseashti shi s-pãteadzi, va hibã ascãpat. Ma atsel tsi nu ari pistipsit va hibã giudicat. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Aesti suntu seamnili tsi va s-urmeadzã atselji tsi va pistipseascã: tu numa a mea elji va li aĝuneascã demonjlji sh-va greascã limbi nali, <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />va acatsã cu mãna nãpãrtitsli, sh-macã va s-bea tsiva ti muriri, nu va s-facã tsiva arãu, va s-bagã mãnjili pi lãndzitslji sh-aeshti va s-vindicã.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Scularea al Isus tu Tser</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Domnul Isus, dupã tsi lã gãri a lor, si anãltsã tu tser shi s-apunã tu nandreapta a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Deapoea elji fudzirã sh-predicarã iutsido, iarã Domnul lucra deadun cu nãshi sh-alihipsea zborlu cu seamnili tsi lu urma. Amin.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:9-20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aesti stihuri nu s-aflã tu alti manuscrisi</char></note><verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>